</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;If `EMBEDDING_QUERY_PREFIX` or `EMBEDDING_DOCUMENT_PREFIX` is also configured for these bindings, LightRAG logs a warning and ignores the prefixes.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
