</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;| Text task prefixes | `openai`, `azure_openai`, `ollama` | LightRAG prepends configured text prefixes before calling the embedding API. Use this only when the model card explicitly requires separate query/document prefixes. &quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">17.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cd74b84904f076da611686fd7750bdea</data>
</node>
