<node id="&quot;VECTOR STORE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"SUBSYSTEM"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Do not reuse an existing vector store across asymmetric embedding configuration changes.&lt;SEP&gt;"The vector store subsystem allows for the implementation of custom vector stores.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b3a691fd7a7b44653de8f16248cba628&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd74b84904f076da611686fd7750bdea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GEMINI&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CLIENT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Backend that exposes the LightRAG REST API surface.&lt;SEP&gt;"LightRAG passes query/document context to the provider-specific `task_type` for Gemini.&lt;SEP&gt;"The LightRAG Server supports gemini as an LLM backend.&lt;SEP&gt;"The LightRAG Server supports gemini as an embedding backend.&lt;SEP&gt;"One of the supported backends that expose the LightRAG REST API surface.&lt;SEP&gt;"gemini is a supported LLM backend.&lt;SEP&gt;"gemini is a supported embedding backend.&lt;SEP&gt;"Google GenAI client passes `{ROLE}_LLM_BINDING_HOST`.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2222a5f74e1118344a0513e7d693837a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8286dc1e92acbe46895a3e4b4adbe05d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd74b84904f076da611686fd7750bdea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84523726bee4688a44b0a4ac3253a74c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMBEDDING_DOCUMENT_PREFIX&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"PARAMETER"</data>
  <data key="d4">"An environment variable used to configure the prefix for document embeddings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Do not configure `EMBEDDING_QUERY_PREFIX` or `EMBEDDING_DOCUMENT_PREFIX`.&lt;SEP&gt;"EMBEDDING_DOCUMENT_PREFIX is set to 'search_document:' in the environment variables.&lt;SEP&gt;"The EMBEDDING_DOCUMENT_PREFIX variable sets the document prefix for prefix-based asymmetric embeddings.&lt;SEP&gt;"EMBEDDING_DOCUMENT_PREFIX is set to search_document: , indicating the prefix for documents.&lt;SEP&gt;"The parameter EMBEDDING_DOCUMENT_PREFIX is set to search_document: ."</data>
