<node id="&quot;EMBEDDING_ASYMMETRIC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"VARIABLE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"An environment variable that determines the embedding mode, either symmetric or asymmetric."&lt;SEP&gt;"EMBEDDING_ASYMMETRIC is set to false.&lt;SEP&gt;"EMBEDDING_ASYMMETRIC is unset in the environment variables.&lt;SEP&gt;"For these models, do not set `EMBEDDING_ASYMMETRIC=true`. Leave it unset or set it to `false`.&lt;SEP&gt;"When `EMBEDDING_ASYMMETRIC` is unset, LightRAG does not enable asymmetric embedding behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;"The EMBEDDING_ASYMMETRIC variable enables query/document asymmetric embeddings.&lt;SEP&gt;"EMBEDDING_ASYMMETRIC is set to true, indicating asymmetric embedding is enabled.&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable `EMBEDDING_ASYMMETRIC` is set to `true` for asymmetric embedding.&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable `EMBEDDING_ASYMMETRIC` is set to enable asymmetric embedding.&lt;SEP&gt;"The parameter EMBEDDING_ASYMMETRIC is set to true.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b365e355f26b9e2eac9eff4198039b0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0ff5c99c56fa54fe27e56cb06863931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a5f058377b951c53da07f784f3944ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd74b84904f076da611686fd7750bdea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ea9b2e06bd3e26acee17a3b67d9a834</data>
</node>
