<node id="&quot;OPENAI&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"SERVICE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Backend that exposes the LightRAG REST API surface and is compatible with OpenAI.&lt;SEP&gt;"LightRAG prepends configured text prefixes for OpenAI.&lt;SEP&gt;"The LightRAG Server supports openai as an LLM backend.&lt;SEP&gt;"The LightRAG Server supports openai as an embedding backend.&lt;SEP&gt;"One of the supported backends that expose the LightRAG REST API surface, compatible with OpenAI.&lt;SEP&gt;"openai is a supported LLM backend.&lt;SEP&gt;"openai is a supported embedding backend.&lt;SEP&gt;"Consider manually adding 'openai' package."&lt;SEP&gt;"LightRAG dynamically installs `openai` as an LLM provider package.&lt;SEP&gt;"LightRAG dynamically installs `openai` as an LLM provider package."&lt;SEP&gt;"KEYWORD_LLM_BINDING is set to openai.&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM_BINDING is set to openai.&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_LLM_BINDING is set to use the openai provider for the vision-language model.&lt;SEP&gt;"openai is a provider for LLM bindings.&lt;SEP&gt;"openai is the provider for the language model.&lt;SEP&gt;"Relaxing or tightening a version constraint for openai updates `uv.lock`."&lt;SEP&gt;"Relaxing or tightening version constraints for `openai` updates `uv.lock`.&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is mentioned as a service for which workspace variables need to be set up.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-724331b1e2f5105ca6162abeddd355d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56d43eaedfdb0bd6c70bdaa2381e96ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84523726bee4688a44b0a4ac3253a74c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-640e5c41fd121c0003f70f439e8b3b48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd8d0f765dba1ebb19ea63bd03bee31b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-282ce1c61fc13efc3e86b9d5f4e51547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8286dc1e92acbe46895a3e4b4adbe05d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd74b84904f076da611686fd7750bdea</data>
</node>
