<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;A `.env` mounted read-only as `0600`/`0400` owned by a different uid will fail to load (clear `PermissionError` at startup); make it readable by uid 1000, or supply configuration via environment variables instead (`env_file:` / `environment:`, or k8s `env` / `envFrom`).&quot;">
