<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The image starts as root and drops privileges at runtime (the pattern used by the official PostgreSQL/Redis images), so the *running process* is non-root while the image's configured `USER` is still root. Scanners that judge CIS 4.1 purely from the `USER` directive may still flag the image even though no server process runs as root.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
