<node id="&quot;ASYMMETRIC EMBEDDING CONFIGURATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Before changing settings for asymmetric embedding, refer to the Asymmetric Embedding Configuration document.&lt;SEP&gt;"Before enabling asymmetric embedding, consult the Asymmetric Embedding Configuration document.&lt;SEP&gt;"Full validation rules and examples of asymmetric embedding configuration can be found in the provided document.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Asymmetric Embedding Configuration document should be reviewed before changing settings.&lt;SEP&gt;"The document provides information on prefix validation rules and provider-specific behavior for asymmetric embeddings.&lt;SEP&gt;"The embedding model and asymmetric embedding configuration must be determined before document indexing.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a5f058377b951c53da07f784f3944ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-021f97620f79cb0c99aad301145dfec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ea9b2e06bd3e26acee17a3b67d9a834</data>
</node>
