  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"SOFTWARE PACKAGE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"LightRAG dynamically installs `transformers` as an LLM provider package.&lt;SEP&gt;"LightRAG dynamically installs `transformers` as an LLM provider package."&lt;SEP&gt;"Software packages requiring `transformers` are not included in the offline dependency group because they are high compute resource demanding and not integrated into LightRAG."&lt;SEP&gt;"Software packages requiring `transformers`, `torch`, or `cuda` are not preinstalled in the docker images."</data>
