<node id="&quot;DOCKER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"TOOL"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Docker is used for deployment of the Knowledge Graph Retrieval-Augmented Generation system.&lt;SEP&gt;"Docker is used in the deployment of docling-serve.&lt;SEP&gt;"Docker is used to run the LightRAG service in containers. "&lt;SEP&gt;"LightRAG Docker image is pre-configured for offline operation, so Docker does not need to refer to this document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Docker is used for easy installation of PostgreSQL for LightRAG storage solutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Docker is used for installation without plugins.&lt;SEP&gt;"The installation is done with Docker.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a95e21c3d4aa9dd77f673c11a10f2f2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b9c9df7784c6448099a1a7853640291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d01ff0c3484b2ce9e7b7c81987558e93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f3acc7d1050e16d5cc8de39fec3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-282ce1c61fc13efc3e86b9d5f4e51547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ea9b2e06bd3e26acee17a3b67d9a834</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EFFICIENT PACKAGE CACHING&quot;">
