  <data key="d4">"UV and Bun package downloads are cached to improve build efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7ea9b2e06bd3e26acee17a3b67d9a834</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCLING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"PARSER"</data>
  <data key="d4">"- **docling**: `label="title"` → level 1, `label="section_header"` → `item.level + 1` (default level 2), likewise maintaining the parent chain."&lt;SEP&gt;"Configuration settings are specified for DOCLING.&lt;SEP&gt;"Docling will be decoupled and deployed as a standalone service."&lt;SEP&gt;"Document extraction tools such as Docling cannot be used in an offline environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"One of the file content extraction engines is docling."&lt;SEP&gt;"Only the `mineru` and `docling` engines accept engine parameters. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The `docling` engine is an external content extraction engine that requires the service to be running and the endpoint/token to be configured in LightRAG. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The `docling` engine is an external content extraction engine. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The `docling` engine is supported with the parameters `force_ocr`."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `docling` engine supports the file formats `pdf`, `docx`, `pptx`, `xlsx`, `md`, `html`, `xhtml`, `png`, `jpg`, `jpeg`, `tiff`, `webp`, `bmp`."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `docling` system keeps the original file first for the pipeline to parse."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `native` / `mineru` / `docling` paths enqueue with `pending_parse`.&lt;SEP&gt;"The document `scan.[docling(force_ocr=true)].pdf` uses the `docling` engine with the parameter `force_ocr=true`."&lt;SEP&gt;"The file slides is set to use the docling engine as specified in the filename hint.&lt;SEP&gt;"docling is an engine that invalidates the cache and re-parses file content on the next upload of the same file."&lt;SEP&gt;"Docling, a document extraction tool, is not part of the offline installation support because it requires high compute resources and is not integrated into LightRAG."&lt;SEP&gt;"Docling parser is used for other supported formats with P."&lt;SEP&gt;"The P strategy is valid for the structured output of `docling` parser that can produce a `.blocks.jsonl` sidecar."&lt;SEP&gt;"The parser uses docling for heading-driven structural splitting "</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c57c83519f50b4e9e94ec0fa78d3401a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-631139d87a5854bded80f7eef24fed9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f62767a155c127d2e19bb2a763d570c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3219553e6504cf126a5429743398bc71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02c5bff8f2fe6a621cc9a6ced39ccfaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04c25eb38b88488839f25538326154e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a157ba8bb77c0492f14d1d2322564184&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6cea8687c979b2611fc1fbab8d9e8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-502fd83a7f153d429f3536ae34c05bb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-282ce1c61fc13efc3e86b9d5f4e51547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3823ede94fd87dec38980f3c5e83b533&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbdf17e3767d2cc6b62e0485bfedf7c</data>
</node>
