<node id="&quot;POSTGRESQL/REDIS IMAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"IMAGE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The pattern used by the official PostgreSQL/Redis images is to start as root and drop privileges at runtime.</data>
