  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"SOFTWARE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"LMDeploy, a local LLM model, is not part of the offline installation support due to high compute resource demands and non-integration into LightRAG."&lt;SEP&gt;"LightRAG dynamically installs `lmdeploy` as an LLM provider package.&lt;SEP&gt;"LightRAG dynamically installs `lmdeploy` as an LLM provider package."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local LLM models like Hugging Face and LMDeploy cannot be used in an offline environment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-282ce1c61fc13efc3e86b9d5f4e51547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbdf17e3767d2cc6b62e0485bfedf7c</data>
