  <data key="d4">"Server Configuration is a section in the env.example file."&lt;SEP&gt;"Server configuration settings are available in the .env file.&lt;SEP&gt;"The server configuration settings are defined in the .env file.&lt;SEP&gt;"Server configuration settings for LightRAG."</data>
