</node>
<node id="&quot;LIGHTRAG SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"SERVICE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The command is used to start the LightRAG service, which is a document management system. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The lightrag service is the service in the generated docker-compose.final.yml.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7ea9b2e06bd3e26acee17a3b67d9a834&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f3acc7d1050e16d5cc8de39fec3a4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTERACTIVE SETUP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"TOOL"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The interactive setup defaults PostgreSQL to `gzdaniel/postgres-for-rag:pg18-age-pgvector`."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interactive setup process keeps the .env file host-usable.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7ea9b2e06bd3e26acee17a3b67d9a834&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbdf17e3767d2cc6b62e0485bfedf7c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMBEDDING MODEL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Changing the embedding model affects vector semantics.&lt;SEP&gt;"Embedding model is set up in `env-base`."&lt;SEP&gt;"Running `make env-base` will prompt to run the embedding model locally via Docker.&lt;SEP&gt;"The LightRAG Server requires an Embedding Model for effective indexing and querying operations.&lt;SEP&gt;"The choice of embedding model must be determined before indexing documents and should remain consistent during query phases.&lt;SEP&gt;"The deployment requires the selection of an embedding model and the configuration of the embedding dimensions. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The embedding model and asymmetric embedding configuration must be determined before document indexing.&lt;SEP&gt;"Changing the embedding model changes vector semantics.&lt;SEP&gt;"LightRAG requires an Embedding Model for document indexing and querying.&lt;SEP&gt;"The embedding model and asymmetric embedding configuration must be determined before document indexing.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-021f97620f79cb0c99aad301145dfec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12c55028ed60ac15f2cc10cf11febe66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f3acc7d1050e16d5cc8de39fec3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8286dc1e92acbe46895a3e4b4adbe05d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d78cb23a1beadc3e7c5c84bc0595ed1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PORT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"PORT is a configuration in Server Configuration section."&lt;SEP&gt;"The PORT variable configures the server port.&lt;SEP&gt;"PORT is set to '9621' for server configuration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable `PORT` is set to `9621` in `site01.env`.&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable `PORT` is set to `9621` in `site02.env`.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ea9b2e06bd3e26acee17a3b67d9a834&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ff6c169abcd9da4c26e2eca92a0f7ad</data>
</node>
