  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The container drops to a non-root user with uid 1000 using `gosu`.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7ea9b2e06bd3e26acee17a3b67d9a834</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;--CERTIFICATE-IDENTITY-REGEXP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"FLAG"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The command uses `--certificate-identity-regexp` flag to match the certificate identity.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e053c231da95e8308a636f1722278568</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUILDKIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"SOFTWARE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"BuildKit is automatically enabled by the `# syntax=docker/dockerfile:1` directive in the Dockerfile, ensuring optimal caching performance.&lt;SEP&gt;"BuildKit is used for automatic cache management and faster rebuilds during Docker builds.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7ea9b2e06bd3e26acee17a3b67d9a834&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbdf17e3767d2cc6b62e0485bfedf7c</data>
</node>
