  <data key="d4">"The `vllm-embed` service has defined deployment settings.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `vllm-rerank` service has defined deployment settings.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-12c55028ed60ac15f2cc10cf11febe66</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RERUNS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d4">"On reruns, unchanged wizard-managed service blocks in docker-compose.final.yml are preserved by default.</data>
