</node>
<node id="&quot;APACHE AGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Apache AGE is a GraphDB technology that can be used with PostgreSQL for LightRAG."&lt;SEP&gt;"Apache AGE is not recommended for high-performance graph database requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dockerfile starts from `pgvector/pgvector:pg18-trixie`, builds Apache AGE for PostgreSQL 18."&lt;SEP&gt;"The image bundles Apache AGE for PostgreSQL 18."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a95e21c3d4aa9dd77f673c11a10f2f2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbdf17e3767d2cc6b62e0485bfedf7c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RERANK SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"SERVICE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Running `make env-base` will prompt to run the rerank service locally via Docker.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-12c55028ed60ac15f2cc10cf11febe66</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LLM CONFIGURATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"LLM Configuration is a section in the env.example file."&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM configuration settings are available in the .env file.&lt;SEP&gt;"The LLM configuration settings are defined in the .env file.&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM configuration settings for LightRAG."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7ea9b2e06bd3e26acee17a3b67d9a834&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e</data>
</node>
