  <data key="d2">chunk-8fbdf17e3767d2cc6b62e0485bfedf7c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BAAI/BGE-M3&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"MODEL"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The embedding service uses `BAAI/bge-m3` on port 8001.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-12c55028ed60ac15f2cc10cf11febe66</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LLM_BINDING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"VARIABLE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Base LLM provider. Supported values are `openai`, `ollama`, `lollms`, `azure_openai`, `bedrock`, and `gemini."&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM_BINDING is a configuration in LLM Configuration section."&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM_BINDING is an environment variable in the .env file.&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM_BINDING is set to openai in the example."&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM_BINDING is used to select the LLM backend type.&lt;SEP&gt;"The LLM_BINDING variable specifies the LLM backend to use.&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM_BINDING is set to 'openai' for LLM configuration settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `LLM_BINDING` setting specifies the service to be used.&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable `LLM_BINDING` is used to select the LLM backend type.&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable for the LLM binding is defined in the `.env` file.&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM_BINDING is set to openai.&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM_BINDING set to openai for Same Provider, Change the Model and Tune Options.&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM_BINDING set to openai for Same Provider, Only Change the Model."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-724331b1e2f5105ca6162abeddd355d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-082eb07a755d44999510e8f240806102&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-021f97620f79cb0c99aad301145dfec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-280dedf626baee86fc0d61cdd836e6ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2222a5f74e1118344a0513e7d693837a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a5f058377b951c53da07f784f3944ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ea9b2e06bd3e26acee17a3b67d9a834</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NO MANUAL `CHOWN` IS NEEDED WHEN UPGRADING FROM AN OLDER IMAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d4">"No manual `chown` operation is required when upgrading from an older image.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7ea9b2e06bd3e26acee17a3b67d9a834</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULAR EXPRESSION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `--certificate-identity-regexp` flag uses a regular expression to match the certificate identity.&lt;SEP&gt;"The value for `--certificate-identity-regexp` is a regular expression that matches the certificate identity.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e053c231da95e8308a636f1722278568</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUILD SCRIPT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"SCRIPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The build script will check Docker registry login status, create/use buildx builder automatically, build for both AMD64 and ARM64 architectures, push to GitHub Container Registry (ghcr.io), and verify the multi-architecture manifest.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8fbdf17e3767d2cc6b62e0485bfedf7c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESERVATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
