  <data key="d4">"The `vllm-embed` service has defined reservations.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `vllm-rerank` service has defined reservations.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-12c55028ed60ac15f2cc10cf11febe66</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAKE ENV-BASE-REWRITE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"COMMAND"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The command make env-base-rewrite is used to regenerate the wizard-managed service blocks.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7ea9b2e06bd3e26acee17a3b67d9a834</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PGGRAPHSTORAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"If PGGraphStorage is not required, you may replace the image with the latest official pgvector image."&lt;SEP&gt;"The generated stack works with `PGGraphStorage` and `PGVectorStorage` without extra extension setup."&lt;SEP&gt;"PGGraphStorage adds a workspace prefix to the collection name for data isolation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1417f2fecf74afcbf4d69be846fd679a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbdf17e3767d2cc6b62e0485bfedf7c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PORT 8001&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"PORT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The embedding service runs on port 8001.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-12c55028ed60ac15f2cc10cf11febe66</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LLM_BINDING_HOST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"VARIABLE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Base provider endpoint. For SDK default endpoints, use the corresponding sentinel, such as `DEFAULT_GEMINI_ENDPOINT` or `DEFAULT_BEDROCK_ENDPOINT."&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM_BINDING_HOST is a configuration in LLM Configuration section."&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM_BINDING_HOST is an environment variable in the .env file.&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM_BINDING_HOST is set to https://api.openai.com/v1 in the example."&lt;SEP&gt;"The LLM_BINDING_HOST variable specifies the LLM server host URL.&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM_BINDING_HOST is set to 'https://api.openai.com/v1' for LLM configuration settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable for the LLM binding host is defined in the `.env` file.&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM_BINDING_HOST is set to https://api.openai.com/v1.&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM_BINDING_HOST set to https://api.openai.com/v1 for Same Provider, Change the Model and Tune Options.&lt;SEP&gt;"LLM_BINDING_HOST set to https://api.openai.com/v1 for Same Provider, Only Change the Model.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-724331b1e2f5105ca6162abeddd355d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-082eb07a755d44999510e8f240806102&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-280dedf626baee86fc0d61cdd836e6ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2222a5f74e1118344a0513e7d693837a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a5f058377b951c53da07f784f3944ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ea9b2e06bd3e26acee17a3b67d9a834</data>
