  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Create a `.env` file using the interactive setup wizard.&lt;SEP&gt;"The setup wizard is a tool for generating a `.env` file with configuration options for the LightRAG Server.&lt;SEP&gt;"The setup wizard is used to configure the system for `cpu` and `cuda` devices.&lt;SEP&gt;"The setup wizard uses different images for CPU and CUDA devices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-12c55028ed60ac15f2cc10cf11febe66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-021f97620f79cb0c99aad301145dfec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbdf17e3767d2cc6b62e0485bfedf7c</data>
