<node id="&quot;HOST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"HOST is a configuration in Server Configuration section."&lt;SEP&gt;"IPC is set to host, allowing inter-process communication with the host.&lt;SEP&gt;"The HOST variable configures the server host.&lt;SEP&gt;"The host keeps ownership of `.env`.&lt;SEP&gt;"HOST is set to '0.0.0.0' for server configuration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable `HOST` is set to `0.0.0.0` in `site01.env`.&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable `HOST` is set to `0.0.0.0` in `site02.env`.&lt;SEP&gt;"The text mentions the host annotation, specifying the domain for the Ingress, such as host.example.com."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ff6c169abcd9da4c26e2eca92a0f7ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cedc79909a2121d28e3444802703cf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8695c3b8cfc1cc28382a176ac4d0e7ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12c55028ed60ac15f2cc10cf11febe66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ea9b2e06bd3e26acee17a3b67d9a834</data>
