<node id="&quot;COMMAND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"SOFTWARE FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Running commands is necessary to start the service and check its health. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The `vllm-embed` service command includes setting up the model and port.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `vllm-rerank` service command includes setting up the model and port.&lt;SEP&gt;"The table lists commands that update `uv.lock` and their typical uses."&lt;SEP&gt;"The ':command: app' indicates a specific command within the 'graphrag' program.&lt;SEP&gt;"The documentation implies the existence of a command 'app' used within the graphrag library.&lt;SEP&gt;:command: app is mentioned in the documentation of the graphrag library.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bbc9cbe94e549538ada5a47127f63ede&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12c55028ed60ac15f2cc10cf11febe66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f3acc7d1050e16d5cc8de39fec3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-100681c982044751140d02d193a76196</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMBEDDING_DIM&quot;">
