  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">8.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8cedc79909a2121d28e3444802703cf3</data>
</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The text refers to the use of English punctuation marks like `.?!` for splitting text, which is included in the default settings of the system but excluded in literal matching to avoid mis-splitting numbers and abbreviations.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">6.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8270352cccb49b2bcd5b1d3ab329e22b</data>
</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The `CHUNK_F_OVERLAP_SIZE` environment variable is the strategy-specific overlap setting for the F (forward) chunking strategy if it is not explicitly set.">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">8.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f245702d4300114f106e260ea1773771</data>
</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;These changes are part of an ongoing effort to improve the system's functionality and user experience by addressing the limitations of the previous behavior and ensuring that the system operates efficiently and effectively.">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">8.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b9cacff08851a81dd67802953d0d966e</data>
</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The old version once allowed upload to silently write a FAILED duplicate entry when a same-name record existed; the new rule is fail-fast, leaving no duplicate traces in doc_status. To replace a same-name document, call the `/documents/{doc_id}` delete API first.">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">14.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5b23b4175c6c0f4dc09cf75abdbc8b03</data>
</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The command executed for mineru-api includes --gpu-memory-utilization 0.45 &quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">8.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8cedc79909a2121d28e3444802703cf3</data>
</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The text discusses the splitting of Chinese and mixed Chinese-English documents at semantic boundaries, which is a feature of the system that recognizes Chinese sentence-ending punctuation (`。！？`) and mid-sentence punctuation (`；，`).&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">6.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8270352cccb49b2bcd5b1d3ab329e22b</data>
</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The `CHUNK_R_SIZE` environment variable is the strategy-specific `chunk_token_size` for the R (recursive) chunking strategy if it is not explicitly set.">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">8.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f245702d4300114f106e260ea1773771</data>
</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Re-parse (cache miss) | Clear all files in the directory, then re-download and write manifest.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">7.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a332187a994e8a8bda343951839585b</data>
</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;When two uploads arrive simultaneously (scan cannot acquire exclusivity at this time):">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">14.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5b23b4175c6c0f4dc09cf75abdbc8b03</data>
</node>
