  <data key="d2">chunk-8cedc79909a2121d28e3444802703cf3</data>
</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The text explains that the default settings for splitting Chinese and mixed Chinese-English documents are based on the system's ability to recognize the specific punctuation used in Chinese text, which allows for accurate semantic boundary detection.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">6.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8270352cccb49b2bcd5b1d3ab329e22b</data>
</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The `CHUNK_R_OVERLAP_SIZE` environment variable is the strategy-specific overlap setting for the R (recursive) chunking strategy if it is not explicitly set.">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">8.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f245702d4300114f106e260ea1773771</data>
</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;`DELETE /documents` with `delete_file=True` | `*.parsed/`, `*.mineru_raw/`, and the original file are all deleted together.&quot;">
