</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The original file is moved into the sibling `__parsed__` directory; `native` / `mineru` / `docling` keep the original file first for the pipeline to parse, and only move it to `__parsed__` after successful parsing and writing to `full_docs`.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
