</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Concurrency safety: LightRAG mandates `canonical_basename` uniqueness within the same workspace (HTTP 409 on upload/enqueue), and combined with the pipeline's serialization per document, `*.mineru_raw/` has no concurrent write conflicts and needs no extra locks.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">7.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a332187a994e8a8bda343951839585b</data>
</node>
