</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;No bg task will be falsely rejected due to busy — because enqueue no longer checks busy; the processing loop will not process the same batch repeatedly — because `request_pending` only takes effect between batches and is cleared before each re-pull.">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
