<node id="&quot;FORMAT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Format refers to the specific structure used to present the extracted information.&lt;SEP&gt;"The knowledge fragments and entities are to be added below using the specified format."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `format` attribute indicates the format of the content. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The `format` field indicates the original extension of the table, such as `json`. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The `format` field is `plain_text`, indicating the content format.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `format` field is the original extension of the drawing. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The knowledge fragments should be added using the same format.&lt;SEP&gt;"The format refers to the specific structure or template used to present the extracted information. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The use of 'mkdocs-typer' indicates the documentation is structured in a specific format.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f95d6aa1ada1a445751726c13f57d913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a79bee86d871fa85d9e457899f3ff418&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a32c82568c5545d499bda6e83149ce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbc9cbe94e549538ada5a47127f63ede&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b84c6dc4e56f32ef79bfc21440cf2ef4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1394c48f6affe43ef3462e870a7090e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-821452c2e57f78506ae365dc36678fcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6df28f5232d5c31b9f64164c61a08e65</data>
</node>
