  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"LIGHTRAG_FORCE_REPARSE_DOCLING is set to false for force reparse cache.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `LIGHTRAG_FORCE_REPARSE_DOCLING=true` is required to trigger reparse of DOCLING when needed, as per MinerU §4.3."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `LIGHTRAG_FORCE_REPARSE_DOCLING=true` triggers a reparse of DOCLING if needed."</data>
