<node id="&quot;MINERU_API_TOKEN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ENVIRONMENT VARIABLE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"MINERU_API_TOKEN is a configuration parameter that holds the API token for accessing the MinerU API. "&lt;SEP&gt;"MINERU_API_TOKEN is set to 'your_mineru_api_token', indicating the API token for MinerU parser.&lt;SEP&gt;"The MINERU_API_TOKEN parameter holds the API token for the MinerU API. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The configuration requires a token, which you need to replace with `&lt;your_token&gt;`.&lt;SEP&gt;"The configuration requires creating an API-KEY and setting MINERU_API_TOKEN."&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable 'MINERU_API_TOKEN' is used to provide the API token for MinerU.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c19f3acc7d1050e16d5cc8de39fec3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-329eac639a865519f1557ce9dc303a63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0e2827f0656f23647a5ad5b252099d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0ff5c99c56fa54fe27e56cb06863931</data>
</node>
