<node id="&quot;ENTITIES &quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT "</data>
  <data key="d4">"Entities are extracted from the text units during graph extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities are extracted from the text units during the graph extraction process.&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities are merged when they have the same title and type.&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities are organized into communities through community detection.&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities with the same title and type are merged to create an array of their descriptions.&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity embeddings are generated and stored.&lt;SEP&gt;"Many knowledge fragments with entities were missed in the last extraction, indicating a need to identify entities correctly."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Entities table is exported after graph augmentation.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-45b2ffc333b4ce2b5c8d066e6c3114fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1510fdc0a4611e7ac84d55abc79e6e54</data>
</node>
