</node>
<node id="&quot;P&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"All formats use the chunking strategy P with specified parsers."&lt;SEP&gt;"P is a chunking option orthogonal to the engine "&lt;SEP&gt;"Special case for P's `chunk_token_size` applies to P chunker.&lt;SEP&gt;"`P` is an option that should not be selected for a file, except when necessary."&lt;SEP&gt;"`P` is one of the options that should be selected for a file."&lt;SEP&gt;"The check is for the inclusion of `P` in `full_docs[doc_id].process_options`."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f62767a155c127d2e19bb2a763d570c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f6e0884f12ea67e008e26e0216f0a4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a157ba8bb77c0492f14d1d2322564184&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84523726bee4688a44b0a4ac3253a74c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-821452c2e57f78506ae365dc36678fcb</data>
</node>
