  <data key="d2">chunk-59fa2d582eb20bc136094483fb09d31c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENV.EXAMPLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"FILE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"An example configuration file named `env.example` is provided in the project's root directory.&lt;SEP&gt;"For comprehensive reranker configuration examples, refer to the `env.example` file."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `.env` file is duplicated from the sample file `env.example` and customized for specific requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `env.example` file in the project's root directory contains configuration examples.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `env.example` file serves as a template for configuring the LightRAG Server in the project root directory.&lt;SEP&gt;"The detailed MinerU configuration is in the `env.example` file at the repository root."&lt;SEP&gt;"There is an example environment variable file named `env.example` in the project root directory."&lt;SEP&gt;"env.example is a file with comprehensive reranker configuration examples."&lt;SEP&gt;"env.example is a file with reference snippets for tuning existing deployments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `env.example` file contains a full configuration template.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `env.example` file in the project's root directory contains LLM and embedding configuration examples.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `env.example` file in the project's root directory contains examples of LLM and embedding configurations.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `env.example` file provides the full configuration details.&lt;SEP&gt;"There is an example environment variable file named `env.example` in the root directory of the project."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-021f97620f79cb0c99aad301145dfec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-329eac639a865519f1557ce9dc303a63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7149569405d52b329c2d9c690f051dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a5f058377b951c53da07f784f3944ef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAX_PARALLEL_PARSE_MINERU&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Optional staged-pipeline variable for parser-heavy deployments that specifies parallel parsing for Mineru documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Optional staged-pipeline variable for parser-heavy deployments.&lt;SEP&gt;"The parameter `MAX_PARALLEL_PARSE_MINERU` is set to 2 for processing a large batch of PDFs with local MinerU on a single GPU."&lt;SEP&gt;"The parameter `MAX_PARALLEL_PARSE_MINERU` is set to 3~5 for processing a large batch of PDFs with MinerU cloud service, depending on cloud quota."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f95d6aa1ada1a445751726c13f57d913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84523726bee4688a44b0a4ac3253a74c</data>
</node>
