<node id="&quot;CANONICALIZED NAME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Files are processed based on their canonicalized name in `/documents/scan`.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59fa2d582eb20bc136094483fb09d31c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VLLM STARTUP PRELOAD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"It is recommended to enable vLLM startup preload for MinerU."&lt;SEP&gt;"The feature loads the VLM model into GPU memory at container startup to avoid latency on the first parse request."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-329eac639a865519f1557ce9dc303a63</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOC_ID&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `doc_id` object is the global document ID and uses an MD5 hash format.&lt;SEP&gt;"The document id is part of the blockid computation. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The resume rule applies to documents with an existing `doc_id` in `doc_status`."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f95d6aa1ada1a445751726c13f57d913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a79bee86d871fa85d9e457899f3ff418&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1394c48f6affe43ef3462e870a7090e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIGHTRAG INSTANTIATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The text states that environment variables are read into `addon_params["chunker"]` once when `LightRAG` is instantiated."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f245702d4300114f106e260ea1773771</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIRECTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The process involves clearing all files in the directory, then re-downloading and writing a manifest."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a332187a994e8a8bda343951839585b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;`FULL_DOCS[DOC_ID][&quot;CHUNK_OPTIONS&quot;]` IS A **SLIM SNAPSHOT** — AT ENQUEUE TIME, ONLY THE STRATEGY SUB-DICTIONARY SELECTED BY `PROCESS_OPTIONS` IS KEPT (DEFAULT F), AND THE PARAMETERS OF OTHER STRATEGIES ARE DISCARDED, BECAUSE THE PROCESSING STAGE WILL NOT READ THEM.">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"DESCRIPTION"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Field Structure describes `full_docs[doc_id]["chunk_options"]` as a slim snapshot that keeps only the selected strategy sub-dictionary at enqueue time.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-821452c2e57f78506ae365dc36678fcb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUPPORTED ENGINE HINT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The file with a supported engine hint is processed first if it shares the same canonicalized name.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59fa2d582eb20bc136094483fb09d31c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TITLE-LEVEL CORRECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"It is recommended to enable title-level correction for MinerU."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-329eac639a865519f1557ce9dc303a63</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONCURRENCY AND REENTRY CONSTRAINTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"File dedup logic in "Concurrency and Reentry Constraints" avoids new files from squeezing out the records of already processed files."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f95d6aa1ada1a445751726c13f57d913</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FROZEN SNAPSHOT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The text explains that `full_docs.chunk_options` holds a frozen snapshot of the chunking options at the time of document enqueueing, and it is not affected by changes to environment variables afterward."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f245702d4300114f106e260ea1773771</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MANIFEST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The CLI does not check the manifest for the file being parsed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The process involves writing a manifest after re-downloading and clearing all files in the directory."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f0e2827f0656f23647a5ad5b252099d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a332187a994e8a8bda343951839585b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;`ADDON_PARAMS[&quot;CHUNKER&quot;]` FULL BASELINE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `addon_params["chunker"]` full baseline can be modified at runtime via SDK and affects subsequent enqueues.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-821452c2e57f78506ae365dc36678fcb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NO VARIANT HAS A HINT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"If no variant has a supported engine hint, the first file after sorting is processed.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59fa2d582eb20bc136094483fb09d31c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TITLE-LEVEL CORRECTION FEATURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The title-level correction feature uses an external LLM to correct the title hierarchy of the parsed output, improving the structured artifacts quality."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-329eac639a865519f1557ce9dc303a63</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FULL_DOCS[DOC_ID]&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"`full_docs[doc_id]` is read to determine if content has been extracted."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f95d6aa1ada1a445751726c13f57d913</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHUNKER INVOCATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The chunker is invoked to process documents, using the chunking options from the frozen snapshot of `full_docs.chunk_options`."&lt;SEP&gt;"The text describes the chunker invocation as taking a sub-dictionary from `full_docs.chunk_options` and dispatching it to the appropriate chunking strategy (F/R/V/P) based on `process_options.chunking` selector."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f245702d4300114f106e260ea1773771</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DELETE /DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ACTION"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Deleting /documents with delete_file=False preserves all artifacts, only deleting doc_status and KG data."&lt;SEP&gt;"Deleting /documents with delete_file=True deletes `*.parsed/`, `*.mineru_raw/`, and the original file together."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a332187a994e8a8bda343951839585b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIXED_TOKEN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CHUNKER STRATEGY"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Selector maps to `fixed_token` chunker strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;"fixed_token is a chunker strategy in the `addon_params["chunker"]` full baseline.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-821452c2e57f78506ae365dc36678fcb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARCHIVED TO __PARSED__&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ACTION"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Files that are not processed are archived to the `__parsed__` directory.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59fa2d582eb20bc136094483fb09d31c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STEP 1&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"STEP"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The text describes Step 1 of the advanced configuration process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-329eac639a865519f1557ce9dc303a63</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NATIVE FILE PARSING ENGINE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ENGINE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The Native File Parsing Engine is LightRAG's built-in structured content extractor that runs fully locally without depending on external services such as MinerU / Docling. It works out of the box with no deployment and has runtime dependencies only on `python-docx` and `defusedxml`. It supports markdown parsing with optional `cairosvg` for SVG rasterization."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3823ede94fd87dec38980f3c5e83b533</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES IN THE TABLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The text provides a table listing environment variables, which are read into `addon_params["chunker"]` during the `LightRAG.__init__` stage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f245702d4300114f106e260ea1773771</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;*.PARSED/">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"When delete_file=True, `*.parsed/` is deleted."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a332187a994e8a8bda343951839585b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPLIT_BY_CHARACTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"split_by_character is a parameter in the `addon_params["chunker"]` full baseline.&lt;SEP&gt;"split_by_character is not accepted by the P strategy "</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f62767a155c127d2e19bb2a763d570c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-821452c2e57f78506ae365dc36678fcb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROCESSED RECORD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"RECORD"</data>
  <data key="d4">"A file is treated as processed if the same-name record is already `PROCESSED`.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59fa2d582eb20bc136094483fb09d31c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MINERU.JSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `/root/mineru.json` file is copied from the official image to `mineru-lightrag.json` in the host's current directory."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-329eac639a865519f1557ce9dc303a63</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STRUCTURED CONTENT EXTRACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"COMPONENT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The Native File Parsing Engine is a structured content extractor that runs fully locally without depending on external services such as MinerU / Docling. It works out of the box with no deployment and has runtime dependencies only on `python-docx` and `defusedxml`. It supports markdown parsing with optional `cairosvg` for SVG rasterization."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3823ede94fd87dec38980f3c5e83b533</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MODIFYING ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ACTION"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Changes to environment variables require modification, which involves altering the values of these variables."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f245702d4300114f106e260ea1773771</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;*.MINERU_RAW/">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The scan cycle does not actively garbage collect `*.mineru_raw/`."&lt;SEP&gt;"When delete_file=True, `*.mineru_raw/` is deleted."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a332187a994e8a8bda343951839585b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPLIT_BY_CHARACTER_ONLY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"split_by_character_only is a parameter in the `addon_params["chunker"]` full baseline.&lt;SEP&gt;"split_by_character_only is not accepted by the P strategy "</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f62767a155c127d2e19bb2a763d570c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-821452c2e57f78506ae365dc36678fcb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMITS A WARNING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ACTION"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The system emits a warning when a file is treated as processed.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59fa2d582eb20bc136094483fb09d31c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCKER CREATE COMMAND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"COMMAND"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `docker create` command is used to create a temporary container named `temp_mineru` with the `mineru:latest` image without running it."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-329eac639a865519f1557ce9dc303a63</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXTERNAL SERVICES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The Native File Parsing Engine does not depend on external services such as MinerU / Docling. It works out of the box with no deployment and has runtime dependencies only on `python-docx` and `defusedxml`. It supports markdown parsing with optional `cairosvg` for SVG rasterization."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3823ede94fd87dec38980f3c5e83b533</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NEW `LIGHTRAG` INSTANCE CREATED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Creating a new `LightRAG` instance is an alternative to restarting the service for changes to take effect."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f245702d4300114f106e260ea1773771</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTIFACTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"When delete_file=False, all artifacts are preserved."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a332187a994e8a8bda343951839585b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RECURSIVE_CHARACTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CHUNKER STRATEGY"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Selector maps to `recursive_character` chunker strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;"recursive_character is a chunker strategy in the `addon_params["chunker"]` full baseline.&lt;SEP&gt;"recursive_character is a chunker strategy in the `full_docs[doc_id]["chunk_options"]` slim snapshot.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-821452c2e57f78506ae365dc36678fcb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MOVES THE INPUT FILE TO `__PARSED__` DIRECTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ACTION"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The input file is moved to the `__parsed__` directory when treated as processed.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59fa2d582eb20bc136094483fb09d31c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCKER CP COMMAND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"COMMAND"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `docker cp` command is used to copy the `/root/mineru.json` file from the temporary container `temp_mineru` to the host's current directory as `mineru-lightrag.json`."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-329eac639a865519f1557ce9dc303a63</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VLM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"TYPE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Multimodal analysis for images, tables, equations, and similar sidecar items."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Native File Parsing Engine does not call a VLM during the extraction stage. It works out of the box with no deployment and has runtime dependencies only on `python-docx` and `defusedxml`. It supports markdown parsing with optional `cairosvg` for SVG rasterization."&lt;SEP&gt;"The drawing objects are analyzed by a VLM.&lt;SEP&gt;"Used during the file insertion stage to analyze images. A high-quality model with image recognition capability is required."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vision-language models are recommended for multimodal analysis."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-082eb07a755d44999510e8f240806102&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3823ede94fd87dec38980f3c5e83b533&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33d111aa7def535c2ef43b93f5b747d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-280dedf626baee86fc0d61cdd836e6ac</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NATIVE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"PARSER"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Native parser is used for docx with P."&lt;SEP&gt;"One of the file content extraction engines is native."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `native` engine is LightRAG's built-in structured content extractor that runs fully locally. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The `native` engine is a built-in intelligent structured content extractor. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The `native` engine is a built-in structured content extractor that runs fully locally without depending on external services like MinerU or Docling. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The `native` engine supports the file formats `docx`, `md`, `textpack`."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `native` system keeps the original file first for the pipeline to parse."&lt;SEP&gt;"The P strategy is valid for the structured output of `native` parser that can produce a `.blocks.jsonl` sidecar."&lt;SEP&gt;"The parser uses native heading-driven structural splitting "</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c57c83519f50b4e9e94ec0fa78d3401a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f62767a155c127d2e19bb2a763d570c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04c25eb38b88488839f25538326154e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a157ba8bb77c0492f14d1d2322564184&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6cea8687c979b2611fc1fbab8d9e8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-502fd83a7f153d429f3536ae34c05bb2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHANGES TO ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The text mentions changes to environment variables that can affect how the chunker operates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f245702d4300114f106e260ea1773771</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;KG DATA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"When delete_file=False, KG data is not deleted."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a332187a994e8a8bda343951839585b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEMANTIC_VECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CHUNKER STRATEGY"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Selector maps to `semantic_vector` chunker strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;"semantic_vector is a chunker strategy in the `addon_params["chunker"]` full baseline.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-821452c2e57f78506ae365dc36678fcb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SKIPS ENQUEUEING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ACTION"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Enqueueing the file is skipped when it is treated as processed.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59fa2d582eb20bc136094483fb09d31c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCKER RM COMMAND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"COMMAND"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `docker rm` command is used to remove the temporary container `temp_mineru` after the copy operation is complete."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-329eac639a865519f1557ce9dc303a63</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PYTHON-DOCX&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"SOFTWARE PACKAGE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Document processing dependency `python-docx` is pre-installed with the `api` extras group and no longer requires dynamic installation.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Native File Parsing Engine has runtime dependencies on `python-docx` and `defusedxml`. It supports markdown parsing with optional `cairosvg` for SVG rasterization."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-282ce1c61fc13efc3e86b9d5f4e51547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3823ede94fd87dec38980f3c5e83b533</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ORIGINAL FILE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"FILE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The original file is moved into the `__parsed__` directory."&lt;SEP&gt;"The original file is not moved when parsing fails."&lt;SEP&gt;"When delete_file=True, the original file is deleted."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f6cea8687c979b2611fc1fbab8d9e8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a332187a994e8a8bda343951839585b</data>
</node>
