  <data key="d4">"The Native File Parsing Engine has runtime dependencies on `python-docx` and `defusedxml`. It supports markdown parsing with optional `cairosvg` for SVG rasterization."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3823ede94fd87dec38980f3c5e83b533</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;__PARSED__ DIRECTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
