  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"FILE NAME"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `[hint]` is included in the original filename when archived."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `[hint]` is removed from the canonicalized filename."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f6cea8687c979b2611fc1fbab8d9e8b2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHUNK_OVERLAP_SIZE ENVIRONMENT VARIABLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `CHUNK_OVERLAP_SIZE` environment variable serves as a fallback for the chunker's overlap settings when no strategy-specific overlap settings are defined."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f245702d4300114f106e260ea1773771</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONCURRENCY SAFETY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Concurrency safety is ensured by LightRAG's requirement for `canonical_basename` uniqueness within the workspace and serialization per document, which avoids concurrent write conflicts for `*.mineru_raw/` without the need for extra locks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a332187a994e8a8bda343951839585b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AFTER UPGRADING, IT IS RECOMMENDED TO RUN A REPROCESS ONCE TO GIVE OLD DOCUMENTS A SLIM `CHUNK_OPTIONS` SNAPSHOT (ALIGNED WITH THE CURRENT `PROCESS_OPTIONS`).&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"DESCRIPTION"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Backward Compatibility for Missing Fields recommends running a reprocess to update old documents with a slim `chunk_options` snapshot.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-821452c2e57f78506ae365dc36678fcb</data>
</node>
