  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Internally the implementation uses paragraphs as temporary fields "&lt;SEP&gt;"`native` includes hyperlink text and list auto-numbering; tracked changes keep only the final text (deletions removed). The recognized paragraphs are written to the `blocks.jsonl` sidecar."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f62767a155c127d2e19bb2a763d570c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3823ede94fd87dec38980f3c5e83b533</data>
