<node id="&quot;ENDPOINT_SIGNATURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The 'either side empty → skip' rule for `endpoint_signature` is the same as in MinerU §4.3."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `endpoint_signature` is used to validate `DOCLING_ENDPOINT` and trigger a cache miss if they do not match."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `endpoint_signature` recorded in the manifest must be consistent with the endpoint for the current mode to avoid a cache miss."</data>
