<node id="&quot;APIPELINE_ENQUEUE_DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Background task calls apipeline_enqueue_documents to write the file to the store.&lt;SEP&gt;"Background task calls apipeline_enqueue_documents to write the store.&lt;SEP&gt;"Read doc_status to dedupe and write full_docs/doc_status runs serially under enqueue_serialize lock.&lt;SEP&gt;"The SDK path calls `apipeline_enqueue_documents`.&lt;SEP&gt;"The legacy `apipeline_enqueue_documents` would directly delete non-PROCESSED old records and rebuild them during scan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5b23b4175c6c0f4dc09cf75abdbc8b03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02c5bff8f2fe6a621cc9a6ced39ccfaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9cacff08851a81dd67802953d0d966e</data>
</node>
