<node id="&quot;DESCRIPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Configuration table includes Description "&lt;SEP&gt;"Description provides details about the fields in the `full_docs`.&lt;SEP&gt;"The table includes a field named `Description` with a description."&lt;SEP&gt;"The table includes a field named `Description`."&lt;SEP&gt;"The table includes a field with descriptions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The text provides descriptions of the metadata fields, explaining what each field represents.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `description` column is part of the shared column schema.&lt;SEP&gt;"The communities list includes a description field which provides a description of the community.&lt;SEP&gt;"The community_reports list includes a description field which provides a description of the report.&lt;SEP&gt;"The covariates list includes a description field which provides a description of the behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;"The identifier fields include a description field which provides a description of the identifier.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-813bfd09c5663aba506972a834914fb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f62767a155c127d2e19bb2a763d570c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f79b90a7af3598028d581d94c6d76678&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56cdb6fabeffd233a64c0698cd81ef73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-821452c2e57f78506ae365dc36678fcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6df28f5232d5c31b9f64164c61a08e65</data>
</node>
