<node id="&quot;MINERU-API&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONTAINER"</data>
  <data key="d4">"mineru-api command includes --allow-public-http-client to allow public HTTP clients.&lt;SEP&gt;"mineru-api command includes --host 0.0.0.0 to expose all interfaces.&lt;SEP&gt;"mineru-api command includes --port 8000 to use port 8000.&lt;SEP&gt;"mineru-api container entrypoint is mineru-api.&lt;SEP&gt;"mineru-api container name is mineru-api."&lt;SEP&gt;"mineru-api entrypoint is set to mineru-api."&lt;SEP&gt;"mineru-api exposes port 8000 on the host and port 8000 in the container."&lt;SEP&gt;"mineru-api has a restart policy that is always.&lt;SEP&gt;"mineru-api has devices with driver: nvidia for GPU usage.&lt;SEP&gt;"mineru-api is a container with image mineru:latest."&lt;SEP&gt;"mineru-api restart policy is set to always."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8cedc79909a2121d28e3444802703cf3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SIDECAR GENERATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Whether a sidecar is generated is determined by the document content."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f6cea8687c979b2611fc1fbab8d9e8b2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;V STRATEGY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"METHOD"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The V strategy inherits the top-level resolved value for `chunk_token_size` when it is unset.&lt;SEP&gt;"The V strategy is automatically degraded to R when there is no embedding model."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c57c83519f50b4e9e94ec0fa78d3401a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8270352cccb49b2bcd5b1d3ab329e22b</data>
</node>
