  <data key="d2">chunk-ed4f68e46f6dea178b121e735b681e3b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MARKDOWN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `native` engine also supports Markdown, which splits by heading (ATX `#`), recognizes native pipe tables (with header), HTML `&lt;table&gt;` (with `&lt;thead&gt;`, preserving colspan/rowspan), and block-level equations (a paragraph starting with `$$` and ending with `$$`)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The zip artifact includes Markdown form for human inspection."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8a332187a994e8a8bda343951839585b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3823ede94fd87dec38980f3c5e83b533</data>
</node>
