  <data key="d3">"ENVIRONMENT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"MINERU_MODEL_SOURCE environment variable for mineru-api is set to local.&lt;SEP&gt;"MINERU_MODEL_SOURCE is set to local for mineru-api."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8cedc79909a2121d28e3444802703cf3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCUMENTS/SCAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ENDPOINT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Failed files can be reprocessed by triggering `/documents/scan`.&lt;SEP&gt;"When `/documents/scan` encounters a file with the same name that is already `PROCESSED`, it treats the input file as already processed."&lt;SEP&gt;"When `/documents/scan` finds multiple files with the same canonicalized name, it prefers the file with a supported engine hint."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f6cea8687c979b2611fc1fbab8d9e8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84523726bee4688a44b0a4ac3253a74c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MINERU_API_MODE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ENVIRONMENT VARIABLE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"MINERU_API_MODE is a configuration parameter that sets the mode for using the MinerU API. "&lt;SEP&gt;"MINERU_API_MODE is set to local, indicating the API mode for MINERU.&lt;SEP&gt;"The MINERU_API_MODE is set to local.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `MINERU_API_MODE` must be consistent with the `api_mode` recorded in the manifest to avoid a cache miss."&lt;SEP&gt;"The configuration sets MINERU_API_MODE to `local`."&lt;SEP&gt;"The configuration sets MINERU_API_MODE to `official`."&lt;SEP&gt;"The configuration sets the MINERU_API_MODE to `local` for the local mode.&lt;SEP&gt;"The configuration sets the MINERU_API_MODE to `official` for the cloud API mode.&lt;SEP&gt;"MINERU_API_MODE is set to official, indicating the API mode for MinerU parser.&lt;SEP&gt;"The MINERU_API_MODE parameter is set to 'official' for the MinerU API. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable 'MINERU_API_MODE' is used to set the API mode for MinerU.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0ff5c99c56fa54fe27e56cb06863931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3219553e6504cf126a5429743398bc71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-329eac639a865519f1557ce9dc303a63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a332187a994e8a8bda343951839585b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f3acc7d1050e16d5cc8de39fec3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0e2827f0656f23647a5ad5b252099d6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MULTIMODAL ANALYSIS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Documents undergo multimodal analysis in `q_analyze`.""&lt;SEP&gt;"Processing options control the behavior related to multimodal analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;"Optional multimodal analysis is available during document processing.&lt;SEP&gt;"The v1.5.0rc2 release adds multimodal analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;"The VLM_PROCESS_ENABLE setting indicates that multimodal analysis is enabled.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-724331b1e2f5105ca6162abeddd355d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0ff5c99c56fa54fe27e56cb06863931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b9c9df7784c6448099a1a7853640291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d7fd65aa6723acd55b13afedde44866&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8286dc1e92acbe46895a3e4b4adbe05d</data>
</node>
