  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"FUNCTION"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Canonicalize the basename to be saved.&lt;SEP&gt;"The input parameter is first canonicalized through `canonicalize_parser_hinted_basename`.</data>
