<node id="&quot;PENDING_ENQUEUES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Pending enqueues are set to 0 after all is complete.&lt;SEP&gt;"Pending enqueues are set to 1 for the first upload.&lt;SEP&gt;"Pending enqueues are set to 2 for the second upload.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `pending_enqueues` count is used by the scan endpoint to determine whether to take an exclusive lock.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5b23b4175c6c0f4dc09cf75abdbc8b03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed4f68e46f6dea178b121e735b681e3b</data>
