</node>
<node id="&quot;MINERU_LOCAL_ENDPOINT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ENVIRONMENT VARIABLE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"MINERU_LOCAL_ENDPOINT is set to http://localhost:8000, indicating the local endpoint for MINERU.&lt;SEP&gt;"The MINERU_LOCAL_ENDPOINT is set to http://localhost:8000.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `MINERU_LOCAL_ENDPOINT` must be consistent with the `endpoint_signature` recorded in the manifest to avoid a cache miss."&lt;SEP&gt;"The configuration requires setting MINERU_LOCAL_ENDPOINT to the local server IP and port."&lt;SEP&gt;"The configuration requires setting the MINERU_LOCAL_ENDPOINT to the local server IP and port for the local mode.&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable 'MINERU_LOCAL_ENDPOINT' is used to set the local endpoint for MinerU.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3219553e6504cf126a5429743398bc71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0e2827f0656f23647a5ad5b252099d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-329eac639a865519f1557ce9dc303a63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a332187a994e8a8bda343951839585b</data>
</node>
