</node>
<node id="&quot;DESIGN GOALS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The P strategy has design goals: Align chunk boundaries with the document's native semantic boundaries, Make each chunk understandable on its own at recall time, and Decompose this goal into concrete rules for three scenarios (tables, long blocks, fine-grained sections)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `mineru` engine has design goals."&lt;SEP&gt;"The design goals of the Docling Raw Artifacts Directory are described."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f6cea8687c979b2611fc1fbab8d9e8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c57c83519f50b4e9e94ec0fa78d3401a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a332187a994e8a8bda343951839585b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOCALHOST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"LOCATION"</data>
