  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Environment variables have specific effects on the system.""&lt;SEP&gt;"The effect of the rule is to merge fine-grained clauses toward near `target_ideal` and avoid lumping together small blocks from different topics.</data>
