</node>
<node id="&quot;KNOWLEDGE FRAGMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Knowledge fragments are parts of text that were missed in the extraction process. They are pieces of information that should be included but were not identified previously. "&lt;SEP&gt;"Knowledge fragments refer to parts of information extracted from the text, which could be related to the processing and understanding of the LightRAG system.&lt;SEP&gt;"Knowledge fragments refer to segments of information that were missed in the last extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;"MANY knowledge fragments with entities were missed in the last extraction, indicating incomplete extraction of information from the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Many knowledge fragments were missed in the last extraction process.&lt;SEP&gt;"Many knowledge fragments were missed in the last extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;"Many knowledge fragments were missed in the last extraction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Many knowledge fragments with entities were missed in the last extraction, which need to be added below using the same format."&lt;SEP&gt;"The extraction process missed many knowledge fragments, which are pieces of information that were not extracted correctly."&lt;SEP&gt;"Many knowledge fragments with entities were missed in the last extraction, referring to pieces of information that were not extracted properly.&lt;SEP&gt;"Many knowledge fragments are mentioned that were missed in the last extraction, which should be added below using the same format."&lt;SEP&gt;"Many knowledge fragments were missed in the last extraction, referring to segments of text with entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Many knowledge fragments were missed in the last extraction. These are segments of information that were not properly extracted from the text.&lt;SEP&gt;"Many knowledge fragments are mentioned that were missed in the last extraction."&lt;SEP&gt;"MANY knowledge fragments with entities were missed in the last extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;"Many knowledge fragments were missed in the last extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;"The text implies that many knowledge fragments with entities were missed in the last extraction, suggesting there may be an incomplete analysis or extraction of information from the text.&lt;SEP&gt;"Many knowledge fragments were missed in the last extraction,"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-04c25eb38b88488839f25538326154e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-742706ba2caa2b3584f3a7dd55c34a82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-502fd83a7f153d429f3536ae34c05bb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37ac2e652be419ab7d9491e584ea178d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02c5bff8f2fe6a621cc9a6ced39ccfaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84523726bee4688a44b0a4ac3253a74c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b84c6dc4e56f32ef79bfc21440cf2ef4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6cea8687c979b2611fc1fbab8d9e8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6c748ee608ace11e7d348ea0448f352&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f95d6aa1ada1a445751726c13f57d913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a32c82568c5545d499bda6e83149ce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-100681c982044751140d02d193a76196&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-280dedf626baee86fc0d61cdd836e6ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3823ede94fd87dec38980f3c5e83b533&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed4f68e46f6dea178b121e735b681e3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b9c9df7784c6448099a1a7853640291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-821452c2e57f78506ae365dc36678fcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7149569405d52b329c2d9c690f051dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9de68fb6438d36191c59a2bd51dc2410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d78cb23a1beadc3e7c5c84bc0595ed1</data>
</node>
