<node id="&quot;ENTITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Entities are extracted from the TextUnits."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities are specific items or concepts mentioned in the text that were not previously identified. "&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities are the subjects or objects within the knowledge fragments that were missed.&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities within the knowledge fragments were missed in the last extraction and need to be added below using the same format."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities within the knowledge fragments were missed in the last extraction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities within the knowledge fragments were missed.&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities, which are specific objects, people, places, or things mentioned in the text, were missed in the extraction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Many entities within the knowledge fragments were missed in the last extraction."&lt;SEP&gt;"The missed knowledge fragments include entities.&lt;SEP&gt;"The missed knowledge fragments included entities.&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities refer to specific things mentioned in the knowledge fragments that were missed.&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities refer to specific items or concepts that were not properly identified in the last extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;"Many knowledge fragments with entities were missed in the last extraction, indicating the presence of entities within these segments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The last extraction missed many entities, which should be added using the same format mentioned.&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that were missed in the last extraction, which are specific items or concepts mentioned in the text that should have been identified.&lt;SEP&gt;"Many entities within those knowledge fragments were missed in the last extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;"The entities within the missed knowdge fragments were not extracted. "&lt;SEP&gt;"Many entities within the knowledge fragments were missed.&lt;SEP&gt;"The text refers to entities that were missed during the last extraction process.&lt;SEP&gt;"The extracted claim information contains statements about entities which may be time-bound."&lt;SEP&gt;"The output includes a list of all entities found in the data by the LM.&lt;SEP&gt;"Many knowledge fragments were missed because entities were not identified,"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-04c25eb38b88488839f25538326154e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e8c003efcd580037bb1cdeb5a33b78f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-742706ba2caa2b3584f3a7dd55c34a82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37ac2e652be419ab7d9491e584ea178d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02c5bff8f2fe6a621cc9a6ced39ccfaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f79b90a7af3598028d581d94c6d76678&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84523726bee4688a44b0a4ac3253a74c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6cea8687c979b2611fc1fbab8d9e8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f95d6aa1ada1a445751726c13f57d913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a32c82568c5545d499bda6e83149ce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-100681c982044751140d02d193a76196&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-280dedf626baee86fc0d61cdd836e6ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3823ede94fd87dec38980f3c5e83b533&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed4f68e46f6dea178b121e735b681e3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b9c9df7784c6448099a1a7853640291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f62767a155c127d2e19bb2a763d570c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71f126a1f713fce89f72bd739d4c81eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-821452c2e57f78506ae365dc36678fcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7149569405d52b329c2d9c690f051dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9de68fb6438d36191c59a2bd51dc2410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d78cb23a1beadc3e7c5c84bc0595ed1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCLING_ENDPOINT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ENVIRONMENT VARIABLE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"DOCLING_ENDPOINT is set to http://localhost:5001 for Docling File Parsing Engine.&lt;SEP&gt;"DOCLING_ENDPOINT is set to http://localhost:5001, indicating the endpoint for DOCLING.&lt;SEP&gt;"The DOCLING_ENDPOINT is set to http://localhost:5001.&lt;SEP&gt;"`DOCLING_ENDPOINT` does not match the `endpoint_signature` recorded in the manifest, triggering a cache miss."&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable 'DOCLING_ENDPOINT' is used to set the endpoint for Docling.&lt;SEP&gt;"The error 'Docling fails to connect to DOCLING_ENDPOINT' occurs when the DOCLING_ENDPOINT environment variable is not set correctly.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3219553e6504cf126a5429743398bc71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0e2827f0656f23647a5ad5b252099d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59fa2d582eb20bc136094483fb09d31c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cedc79909a2121d28e3444802703cf3</data>
</node>
