  <data key="d2">chunk-1d7fd65aa6723acd55b13afedde44866&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a514646a651da9026d7f8eb73aa2f08</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOC_STATUS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"A file is considered a duplicate if it has the same name as an existing file in `doc_status`.&lt;SEP&gt;"Doc_status is written by bg task A.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `doc_status` contains the `doc_id` of documents that have been processed successfully."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `doc_status` is preserved without change for non-PROCESSED records with `full_docs` present.&lt;SEP&gt;"When delete_file=False, doc_status is not deleted."&lt;SEP&gt;"`doc_status` writes or fills in the `content_hash` field.&lt;SEP&gt;"`doc_status` is used for cross-document deduplication."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f95d6aa1ada1a445751726c13f57d913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b23b4175c6c0f4dc09cf75abdbc8b03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02c5bff8f2fe6a621cc9a6ced39ccfaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59fa2d582eb20bc136094483fb09d31c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1394c48f6affe43ef3462e870a7090e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a332187a994e8a8bda343951839585b</data>
</node>
