</node>
<node id="&quot;CHUNK_TOKEN_SIZE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"A single side's budget is capped at no more than `chunk_token_size / 2`."&lt;SEP&gt;"CHUNK_V_SIZE is a parameter for setting chunk_token_size in V strategy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Special case for P's `chunk_token_size` applies to chunk_token_size.&lt;SEP&gt;"The V strategy has a hard cap for chunk_token_size."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `chunk_token_size` parameter defines the maximum number of tokens a chunk can contain, which affects the size of the text segments during chunking."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `chunk_token_size` parameter is a part of the constructor.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `chunk_token_size` parameter is part of the constructor and is tier 3 in the priority chain.&lt;SEP&gt;"The text discusses the fallback behavior for `chunk_token_size` in different strategies."&lt;SEP&gt;"`chunk_token_size` is a critical parameter for chunking, affecting the behavior of different strategies like F, R, and V."&lt;SEP&gt;"chunk_token_size is a parameter in the `addon_params["chunker"]` full baseline.&lt;SEP&gt;"chunk_token_size is a parameter in the `full_docs[doc_id]["chunk_options"]` slim snapshot.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8270352cccb49b2bcd5b1d3ab329e22b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88cc39237fb1678f1803346e3c8046b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a78f97cbe007105c80acba2db42453d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-821452c2e57f78506ae365dc36678fcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f245702d4300114f106e260ea1773771</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MY-PROPOSAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"FILE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The file my-proposal is set to use the MinerU engine with all processing options default.&lt;SEP&gt;"The file my-proposal is set to use the default engine and only disable knowledge graph construction.&lt;SEP&gt;"The file my-proposal is set to use the native engine with drawing, table, and equation analysis enabled.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3219553e6504cf126a5429743398bc71</data>
</node>
