  <data key="d2">chunk-02c5bff8f2fe6a621cc9a6ced39ccfaf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NATIVE-IET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ENGINE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"File processing configuration is provided for my-proposal.[native-iet].docx to use the native-iet engine.&lt;SEP&gt;"The configuration sets the default content extraction engine for docx files to native-iet.&lt;SEP&gt;"The file my-proposal is set to use the native engine with drawing, table, and equation analysis enabled.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3219553e6504cf126a5429743398bc71</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAX_PARALLEL_INSERT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Controls how many files are processed in parallel."&lt;SEP&gt;"MAX_PARALLEL_INSERT is a configuration in Settings for document indexing section."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parameter that controls how many files are processed in parallel.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `MAX_PARALLEL_INSERT` environment variable sets the number of parallel files to process in one batch."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `MAX_PARALLEL_INSERT` environment variable specifies the number of files processed in parallel, affecting indexing speed.&lt;SEP&gt;"The parameter `MAX_PARALLEL_INSERT` is derived from `MAX_ASYNC_LLM/3` for processing pure docx / txt (only native)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The parameter `MAX_PARALLEL_INSERT` is set to 3 for processing a large batch of PDFs with local MinerU on a single GPU."&lt;SEP&gt;"`MAX_PARALLEL_INSERT` acts as both worker pool size and semaphore cap.""&lt;SEP&gt;"`MAX_PARALLEL_INSERT` is the maximum number of concurrent documents that can be processed at the entity/relation extraction + ingest stage.&lt;SEP&gt;"MAX_PARALLEL_INSERT is set to '3' for document indexing settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'MAX_PARALLEL_INSERT' environment variable defines the number of parallel files to process in one batch.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f95d6aa1ada1a445751726c13f57d913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1417f2fecf74afcbf4d69be846fd679a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d7fd65aa6723acd55b13afedde44866&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84523726bee4688a44b0a4ac3253a74c</data>
</node>
