  <data key="d4">"File processing configuration is provided for my-proposal.[native-iet].docx to enable drawing, table, and equation analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;"The file my-proposal is set to use the native engine with drawing, table, and equation analysis enabled.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `&lt;drawing&gt;` tag is used for drawing placeholders. "&lt;SEP&gt;"Tables, equations, and drawings are extracted as single-line tags (`&lt;table id="..." format="json"&gt;...&lt;/table&gt;` etc.) written to the corresponding sidecar."</data>
