<node id="&quot;TABLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"A table maps each rule of §3 to its effect and the implementing stage.&lt;SEP&gt;"Bridge text is used between consecutive large tables.&lt;SEP&gt;"File processing configuration is provided for my-proposal.[native-iet].docx to enable drawing, table, and equation analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;"The file my-proposal is set to use the native engine with drawing, table, and equation analysis enabled.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `&lt;table&gt;` tag is used for table placeholders. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The table lists concerns, files, contents, and notes.&lt;SEP&gt;"Tables, equations, and drawings are extracted as single-line tags (`&lt;table id="..." format="json"&gt;...&lt;/table&gt;` etc.) written to the corresponding sidecar."&lt;SEP&gt;"The header row is re-injected into a `&lt;table&gt;`."&lt;SEP&gt;"When dealing with tables, the P strategy ensures that tables under a certain size (`table_max`) remain whole, and large tables are sliced along row boundaries and re-wrapped as `&lt;table&gt;` elements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c57c83519f50b4e9e94ec0fa78d3401a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a79bee86d871fa85d9e457899f3ff418&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33d111aa7def535c2ef43b93f5b747d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-631139d87a5854bded80f7eef24fed9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a78f97cbe007105c80acba2db42453d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3219553e6504cf126a5429743398bc71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfdc14720aca7f1c8740b02182c2b4d8</data>
</node>
