<node id="&quot;SCAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Filename hint for the document `scan.[docling(force_ocr=true)].pdf`"&lt;SEP&gt;"Scan deletes stub and enqueues the current file as a new file.&lt;SEP&gt;"Scan handles same-named files per the classification rules in §6.4 (archive / resume / delete stub then re-enqueue), uniformly picked up by the resume rules in §7 inside the processing loop.&lt;SEP&gt;"Scan must be exclusive.&lt;SEP&gt;"Scan process deletes stubs and enqueues the current file as a new file to apply the "fix the source file, scan again" process.&lt;SEP&gt;"Scanning discovers a same-name file already `PROCESSED`.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-04c25eb38b88488839f25538326154e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02c5bff8f2fe6a621cc9a6ced39ccfaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9cacff08851a81dd67802953d0d966e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b23b4175c6c0f4dc09cf75abdbc8b03</data>
</node>
