  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"PARAMETER"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `mineru` engine accepts the `page_range` parameter to specify the page range for extraction. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The `mineru` engine uses the parameter `page_range=1-3` to specify the page range for extraction. It is set to extract pages 1 to 3 from the document. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The `page_range` parameter may contain multiple page segments. "</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-04c25eb38b88488839f25538326154e2</data>
</node>
