<node id="&quot;LANGUAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"STRING"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `mineru` engine accepts the `language` parameter to specify the OCR language. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The `mineru` engine uses the parameter `language=en` to specify the OCR language as English. "&lt;SEP&gt;"language is a string that specifies the output language for various tasks, such as entity and relationship extraction, summaries, keyword extraction, and multimodal analysis prompts. It defaults to `SUMMARY_LANGUAGE` if not explicitly set, with `English` as the fallback.&lt;SEP&gt;"language is a string that specifies the output language used in entity and relationship extraction, entity/relation summaries, keyword extraction, and multimodal analysis prompts. It defaults to `SUMMARY_LANGUAGE`, then `English`.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c74b3a56df033faf9eedb477d804a55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04c25eb38b88488839f25538326154e2</data>
</node>
