<node id="&quot;CHUNK_P_SIZE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"CHUNK_P_SIZE is a configuration in Settings for document indexing section."&lt;SEP&gt;"CHUNK_P_SIZE is a parameter for chunking, with a value of '2000' (`DEFAULT_CHUNK_P_SIZE`)."&lt;SEP&gt;"P's chunk_token_size resolves directly via `CHUNK_P_SIZE` env, which is set to `DEFAULT_CHUNK_P_SIZE` (2000) when not explicitly provided."&lt;SEP&gt;"Special case for P's `chunk_token_size` resolves directly via CHUNK_P_SIZE env.&lt;SEP&gt;"The rationale is provided in the `CHUNK_P_SIZE` row in §3.2.&lt;SEP&gt;"Strategy-specific variable for chunking with size for `P` type chunks."&lt;SEP&gt;"CHUNK_P_SIZE is commented out, indicating it is not set for document indexing settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Strategy-specific variable for chunker configuration that specifies the size of `P` chunks."&lt;SEP&gt;"CHUNK_P_SIZE is a configuration with default `2000` "&lt;SEP&gt;"The parameter sets the size of the chunking P."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8270352cccb49b2bcd5b1d3ab329e22b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f62767a155c127d2e19bb2a763d570c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a157ba8bb77c0492f14d1d2322564184&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84523726bee4688a44b0a4ac3253a74c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-821452c2e57f78506ae365dc36678fcb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;KNOWLEDGE GRAPH CONSTRUCTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"PROCESS OPTION"</data>
  <data key="d4">"File processing configuration is provided for my-memo.[native-R!].docx to disable knowledge graph construction.&lt;SEP&gt;"Processing options control the behavior related to knowledge graph construction.&lt;SEP&gt;"The file my-memo is set to use the native engine with recursive semantic chunking and disable knowledge graph construction.&lt;SEP&gt;"The file my-proposal is set to use the default engine and only disable knowledge graph construction.&lt;SEP&gt;"Knowledge graph construction is disabled if the file does not enable it.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3219553e6504cf126a5429743398bc71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0ff5c99c56fa54fe27e56cb06863931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b9c9df7784c6448099a1a7853640291</data>
