<node id="&quot;TEXT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Text between different `.blocks.jsonl` content lines is never copied into each other's chunks.&lt;SEP&gt;"Text between different `.blocks.jsonl` content lines is not copied into each other's chunks.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `ainsert` method is called with a `text` parameter.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `text` column contains the full text of the document.&lt;SEP&gt;"The documents list includes a text field which is the full text of the document.</data>
