<node id="&quot;LEGACY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ENGINE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"One of the file content extraction engines is legacy."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `legacy` engine is a legacy extraction engine that supports various file formats. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The `legacy` engine supports the file formats `txt`, `md`, `mdx`, `pdf`, `docx`, `pptx`, `xlsx`, `rtf`, `odt`, `tex`, `epub`, `html`, `htm`, `csv`, `json`, `xml`, `yaml`, `yml`, `log`, `conf`, `ini`, `properties`, `sql`, `bat`, `sh`, `c`, `h`, `cpp`, `hpp`, `py`, `java`, `js`, `ts`, `swift`, `go`, `rb`, `php`, `css`, `scss`, `less`."&lt;SEP&gt;"The configuration specifies the engine to be used for different file extensions.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3219553e6504cf126a5429743398bc71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-502fd83a7f153d429f3536ae34c05bb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04c25eb38b88488839f25538326154e2</data>
