<node id="&quot;LIGHTRAG_PARSER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"A typical LIGHTRAG_PARSER setup enables P "&lt;SEP&gt;"LIGHTRAG_PARSER is a configuration in Settings for document indexing section."&lt;SEP&gt;"LIGHTRAG_PARSER is a configuration parameter that selects the document parser for LightRAG. "&lt;SEP&gt;"Leave `LIGHTRAG_PARSER` unconfigured to keep the legacy file-processing behavior, or set it to a specific value."&lt;SEP&gt;"The LIGHTRAG_PARSER environment variable sets default rules by file extension."&lt;SEP&gt;"The configuration sets the default content extraction engine for docx files to native-iet.&lt;SEP&gt;"The configuration sets the default content extraction engine for pdf files to legacy-R with chunking parameters chunk_ts=800 and chunk_ol=80, and sets the default engine for all other files to legacy-R.&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable `LIGHTRAG_PARSER` is set to `pdf:mineru(language=en);*:legacy-R` which defines the parsing rule for the document. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The LIGHTRAG_PARSER configuration keeps the old file-processing behavior while upgrading the server.&lt;SEP&gt;"LIGHTRAG_PARSER is set to '*:native-teP,*:legacy-R' for document indexing settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Set LIGHTRAG_PARSER to keep the old file-processing behavior while upgrading the server.&lt;SEP&gt;"LIGHTRAG_PARSER is a system setup for parsing, enabling P."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f62767a155c127d2e19bb2a763d570c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3219553e6504cf126a5429743398bc71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04c25eb38b88488839f25538326154e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a157ba8bb77c0492f14d1d2322564184&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-502fd83a7f153d429f3536ae34c05bb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f3acc7d1050e16d5cc8de39fec3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8286dc1e92acbe46895a3e4b4adbe05d</data>
</node>
