<node id="&quot;CHUNK_OVERLAP_TOKEN_SIZE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Overlap is allowed up to `chunk_overlap_token_size`.&lt;SEP&gt;"Overlap is maintained by `chunk_overlap_token_size`.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `chunk_overlap_token_size` parameter is a part of the constructor.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `chunk_overlap_token_size` parameter is part of the constructor and is tier 3 in the priority chain.&lt;SEP&gt;"The example specifies `chunk_overlap_token_size` for LightRAG."&lt;SEP&gt;"chunk_overlap_token_size is a parameter in the `full_docs[doc_id]["chunk_options"]` slim snapshot.&lt;SEP&gt;"chunk_overlap_token_size is inherited from CHUNK_P_OVERLAP_SIZE "&lt;SEP&gt;"chunk_overlap_token_size is set to CHUNK_P_OVERLAP_SIZE / chunk_overlap_token_size "</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8270352cccb49b2bcd5b1d3ab329e22b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f62767a155c127d2e19bb2a763d570c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88cc39237fb1678f1803346e3c8046b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfdc14720aca7f1c8740b02182c2b4d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b84c6dc4e56f32ef79bfc21440cf2ef4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-821452c2e57f78506ae365dc36678fcb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHUNK_TS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"PARAMETER"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The configuration sets the default content extraction engine for pdf files to legacy-R with chunking parameters chunk_ts=800 and chunk_ol=80, and sets the default engine for all other files to legacy-R.&lt;SEP&gt;"The file notes is set to use the -R engine with chunking parameters chunk_ts=800 and chunk_ol=80 as specified in the filename hint.&lt;SEP&gt;"The rule specifies the file notes to use the -R engine with chunking parameters chunk_ts=800 and chunk_ol=80.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3219553e6504cf126a5429743398bc71</data>
</node>
