<node id="&quot;CHUNK_SIZE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"CHUNK_SIZE does not inherit CHUNK_P_SIZE "&lt;SEP&gt;"Chunker parameter that specifies the size of chunks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chunker parameter that specifies the size of the chunks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legacy environment variable `CHUNK_SIZE` has lower priority than the constructor parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;"Special case for P's `chunk_token_size` skips legacy env `CHUNK_SIZE`. See the `CHUNK_P_SIZE` row in §3.2 for the rationale.&lt;SEP&gt;"The constructor parameters have higher priority than the legacy env `CHUNK_SIZE`.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f62767a155c127d2e19bb2a763d570c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88cc39237fb1678f1803346e3c8046b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-821452c2e57f78506ae365dc36678fcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84523726bee4688a44b0a4ac3253a74c</data>
</node>
