  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"CHUNK_OVERLAP_SIZE is a configuration with default `100` "&lt;SEP&gt;"CHUNK_OVERLAP_SIZE is inherited from CHUNK_P_OVERLAP_SIZE "&lt;SEP&gt;"Chunker parameter that specifies the overlap size between chunks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legacy environment variable `CHUNK_OVERLAP_SIZE` has lower priority than the constructor parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;"The constructor parameters have higher priority than the legacy env `CHUNK_OVERLAP_SIZE`.&lt;SEP&gt;"Chunker parameter that specifies the overlap size of chunks."</data>
