  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Rules are provided for tables.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `LightRAG Document` format supports multimodal data such as tables."&lt;SEP&gt;"`native` recognizes 2D structure, auto-expanding merged cells (colspan/rowspan) and extracting cross-page repeated headers. The recognized tables are written to the `tables.json` sidecar."&lt;SEP&gt;"Two or three tables are derived from the data for GraphRAG query."&lt;SEP&gt;"Two or three tables are derived from the data to cover the basic use cases for GraphRAG query.</data>
