<node id="&quot;METADATA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Metadata can be configured with structured file formats.&lt;SEP&gt;"Metadata can be included in structured file formats by specifying column names.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `LightRAG Document` format includes the document's section/paragraph metadata."&lt;SEP&gt;"The document includes metadata fields that provide information about the document itself.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `metadata` section is defined.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `ParserSpec` object contains metadata about the parsing engine, which is essential for its registration and recognition by LightRAG.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `metadata` column is an optional dictionary for additional document metadata.&lt;SEP&gt;"The documents list includes a metadata field which is a dictionary of metadata for the document.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-813bfd09c5663aba506972a834914fb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ff6c169abcd9da4c26e2eca92a0f7ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f79b90a7af3598028d581d94c6d76678&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-502fd83a7f153d429f3536ae34c05bb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-befc9ee33b58f79fec1dbee2eaeae5f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6df28f5232d5c31b9f64164c61a08e65</data>
