  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"TOOL"</data>
  <data key="d4">"A JavaScript runtime environment that is recommended for speed.&lt;SEP&gt;"Bun is a modern JavaScript runtime that is recommended for building the frontend, although Node.js/npm is also supported."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bun is recommended as a build tool, but Node.js/npm is fully supported as a fallback."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bun is recommended for speed.&lt;SEP&gt;"Only Bun could resolve the TypeScript path alias (`@/`) at config load time.</data>
