  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The LightRAG project includes a React-based WebUI frontend."&lt;SEP&gt;"The React-based WebUI is a key component of the LightRAG project, providing the user interface for the application. It is built using the React JavaScript library, which is known for its component-based architecture and efficient rendering capabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The WebUI for LightRAG is built using React, a popular JavaScript library for building user interfaces."</data>
