<node id="&quot;GITHUB ACTIONS (AUTOMATED RELEASE)">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Automated release process on GitHub includes building the frontend using Bun, verifying the build, creating a Python package with the frontend, and publishing to PyPI using a trusted publisher setup."&lt;SEP&gt;"GitHub Actions automate the release process, including building the frontend, verifying the build, creating a Python package, and publishing to PyPI."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b8d00e4ce6ff0f87215af7eacdd73129</data>
</node>
