  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Frontend build results are included in PyPI Package (ready to use)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The PyPI Package is a distribution package that includes the frontend build results, making it ready for use by end users."&lt;SEP&gt;"The PyPI Package is the distribution format for the LightRAG project. It includes the built frontend, making it ready for end users to install and use without having to build it themselves. PyPI is the Python Package Index, a repository of software for the Python programming language.</data>
