  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"APPLICATION"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The 'lightrag-server' command is used to start the local server for remote models.&lt;SEP&gt;"The command 'lightrag-server' is used to start the local server."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `lightrag-server` command starts the service in the working directory.&lt;SEP&gt;"The lightrag-server is started to add an Ollama-type connection in the Open WebUI admin panel. A model named `lightrag:latest` appears in the model management interface."&lt;SEP&gt;"`lightrag-server` command is used to start the service.&lt;SEP&gt;"The lightrag-server can be started to add an Ollama-type connection in the Open WebUI admin panel. It provides a model named `lightrag:latest` in Open WebUI's model management interface."&lt;SEP&gt;"`lightrag-server` is run in Terminal 1 with `LIGHTRAG_API_PREFIX=/site01`.</data>
