</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Additionally, LightRAG supports a wide range of storage solutions including PostgreSQL, MongoDB, FAISS, Milvus, Qdrant, Neo4j, Memgraph, Redis, and OpenSearch.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
