</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;LightRAG necessitates the integration of both an LLM (Large Language Model) and an Embedding Model to effectively execute document indexing and querying operations. Prior to the initial deployment of the LightRAG server, it is essential to configure the settings for both the LLM and the Embedding Model.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">5.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8286dc1e92acbe46895a3e4b4adbe05d</data>
</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The current working directory must contain the `.env` configuration file when starting LightRAG, ensuring the server uses the correct settings.">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">8.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-021f97620f79cb0c99aad301145dfec1</data>
</node>
