</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;These values are read at server startup and stored as a per-document `chunk_options` snapshot when a document is enqueued.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">15.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-84523726bee4688a44b0a4ac3253a74c</data>
</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;This addresses issues where certain text blocks (e.g., tables or citations) containing numerous entities and relationships can lead to overly long or even endless loop outputs from LLMs.&quot;">
