</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;`MAX_PARALLEL_INSERT` controls how many files are processed in parallel. `MAX_ASYNC_LLM` (deprecated alias: `MAX_ASYNC`) controls concurrent LLM calls, including extraction, merging, query keyword generation, and final answer generation. Optional staged-pipeline variables such as `MAX_PARALLEL_PARSE_NATIVE`, `MAX_PARALLEL_PARSE_MINERU`, `MAX_PARALLEL_PARSE_DOCLING`, and `MAX_PARALLEL_ANALYZE` can be used for parser-heavy deployments.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">7.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-84523726bee4688a44b0a4ac3253a74c</data>
</node>
