</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Uploads and text inserts can be accepted while the processing loop is busy; the running loop is nudged to pick up the new pending work. Destructive jobs such as document clear/delete and the classification phase of `/documents/scan` still reject concurrent enqueues to protect storage consistency.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
