<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;It is important to note that the LightRAG Server will load the environment variables from `.env` into the system environment variables each time it starts. **LightRAG Server will prioritize the settings in the system environment variables to .env file**.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">15.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-021f97620f79cb0c99aad301145dfec1</data>
</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The output of the last command will give you the endpoint and the key for the OpenAI API. You can use these values to set the environment variables in the `.env` file.">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
