</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Asymmetric embedding is explicit opt-in. Set `EMBEDDING_ASYMMETRIC=true` only when the selected embedding backend supports either provider task parameters or task prefixes. See [Asymmetric Embedding Configuration](./AsymmetricEmbedding.md) before changing these settings, because existing data must be cleared and files re-indexed after any change.">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
