<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;&gt; Please use OpenAI-compatible method to access LLMs deployed by OpenRouter or vLLM/SGLang. You can pass additional parameters to OpenRouter or vLLM/SGLang through the `OPENAI_LLM_EXTRA_BODY` environment variable to disable reasoning mode or achieve other personalized controls.">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
