<node id="&quot;`.ENV` FILE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"FILE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `.env` file holds the configuration settings required to start the LightRAG Server.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `WORKSPACE` environment variable in the `.env` file specifies the workspace name.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-021f97620f79cb0c99aad301145dfec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a514646a651da9026d7f8eb73aa2f08</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IN-MEMORY DATABASE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"DATABASE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"An in-memory database persists data to the WORKING_DIR directory."&lt;SEP&gt;"An in-memory database that persists data to the WORKING_DIR directory."&lt;SEP&gt;"LightRAG uses in-memory databases by default, and independent working directories achieve data isolation.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9a514646a651da9026d7f8eb73aa2f08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44dde1b8fa9d74e9edbda4a6a1d22019</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;--WORKSPACE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"COMMAND-LINE PARAMETER"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Command-line parameter for workspace name."&lt;SEP&gt;"command-line parameter that specifies the workspace name, used to logically isolate data between multiple LightRAG instances (default: empty)</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d7149569405d52b329c2d9c690f051dd</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SETTINGS FOR DOCUMENT INDEXING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Settings for document indexing is a section in the env.example file."&lt;SEP&gt;"Settings for indexing documents in LightRAG."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OPENSEARCHGRAPHSTORAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"OpenSearchGraphStorage uses index name prefixes for data isolation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1417f2fecf74afcbf4d69be846fd679a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CURRENT WORKING DIRECTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `.env` file must be present in the current working directory when starting the LightRAG Server.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-021f97620f79cb0c99aad301145dfec1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WORKING_DIR DIRECTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"DIRECTORY"</data>
  <data key="d4">"An in-memory database persists data to the WORKING_DIR directory."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data is persisted to the WORKING_DIR directory by the in-memory database."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-44dde1b8fa9d74e9edbda4a6a1d22019</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;--API-PREFIX&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"COMMAND-LINE PARAMETER"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Command-line parameter for reverse-proxy path prefix exposed to browsers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Command-line parameter that specifies the reverse-proxy path prefix for the LightRAG API.&lt;SEP&gt;"command-line parameter that specifies the reverse-proxy path prefix exposed to browsers, also configurable with `LIGHTRAG_API_PREFIX`</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d7149569405d52b329c2d9c690f051dd</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENTITY_EXTRACTION_USE_JSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"VARIABLE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"ENTITY_EXTRACTION_USE_JSON is a configuration in Settings for document indexing section."&lt;SEP&gt;"ENTITY_EXTRACTION_USE_JSON is set to 'true' for document indexing settings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OPENSEARCHVECTORDBSTORAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"OpenSearchVectorDBStorage uses index name prefixes for data isolation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1417f2fecf74afcbf4d69be846fd679a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NEW TERMINAL SESSION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ACTION"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Opening a new terminal session is required after modifying the `.env` file to apply the changes.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-021f97620f79cb0c99aad301145dfec1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STORAGE SOLUTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"LightRAG supports a wide range of storage solutions, including PostgreSQL, MongoDB, FAISS, Milvus, Qdrant, Neo4j, Memgraph, Redis, and OpenSearch."&lt;SEP&gt;"LightRAG supports a wide range of storage solutions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-44dde1b8fa9d74e9edbda4a6a1d22019</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;--RERANK-BINDING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"COMMAND-LINE PARAMETER"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Command-line parameter for rerank provider."&lt;SEP&gt;"command-line parameter that specifies the rerank provider (`null`, `cohere`, `jina`, or `aliyun`)</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d7149569405d52b329c2d9c690f051dd</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAX_EXTRACT_INPUT_TOKENS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"VARIABLE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"MAX_EXTRACT_INPUT_TOKENS is a configuration in Settings for document indexing section."&lt;SEP&gt;"MAX_EXTRACT_INPUT_TOKENS is commented out, indicating it is not set for document indexing settings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REDIS_WORKSPACE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ENVIRONMENT VARIABLE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"A dedicated workspace environment variable 'REDIS_WORKSPACE' is provided for Redis.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `REDIS_WORKSPACE` environment variable is used to override the common `WORKSPACE` environment variable configuration for Redis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Storage-specific workspace environment variables include `REDIS_WORKSPACE`."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-99142de25f745182f551fb22af5fa5ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1417f2fecf74afcbf4d69be846fd679a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;POSTGRESQL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"DATABASE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"PostgreSQL has AGE graph storage set to null."&lt;SEP&gt;"PostgreSQL is a database that can be used as an alternative storage solution for LightRAG with additional capabilities such as KV store, VectorDB, and GraphDB (Apache AGE)."&lt;SEP&gt;"PostgreSQL is a supported database system by LightRAG.&lt;SEP&gt;"PostgreSQL is a supported storage solution by LightRAG."&lt;SEP&gt;"The default workspace for PostgreSQL is `default` when no workspace is configured."&lt;SEP&gt;"PostgreSQL is a supported storage solution by LightRAG."&lt;SEP&gt;"The default workspace for PostgreSQL is 'default' without configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;"PostgreSQL version 16.6 or higher is required for the use of its additional capabilities like VectorDB and GraphDB (Apache AGE)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-99142de25f745182f551fb22af5fa5ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a95e21c3d4aa9dd77f673c11a10f2f2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44dde1b8fa9d74e9edbda4a6a1d22019&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1417f2fecf74afcbf4d69be846fd679a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIGHTRAG_API_PREFIX&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Command-line parameter for setting `LIGHTRAG_API_PREFIX` or `--api-prefix`."&lt;SEP&gt;"Command-line parameter for setting the API prefix for the LightRAG instances.&lt;SEP&gt;"Command-line parameter to configure the API prefix.&lt;SEP&gt;"Environment variable that specifies the reverse-proxy path prefix for the LightRAG API.&lt;SEP&gt;"LIGHTRAG_API_PREFIX is a configuration in Server Configuration section."&lt;SEP&gt;"LIGHTRAG_API_PREFIX is commented out, indicating it is not set for server configuration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `LIGHTRAG_API_PREFIX` is a variable used as the reverse-proxy mount prefix and is set for each instance on the backend.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `LIGHTRAG_API_PREFIX` is set per-instance on the backend and is not configurable on the WebUI.&lt;SEP&gt;"The backend should have the `LIGHTRAG_API_PREFIX` configured.&lt;SEP&gt;"The backend should run with the matching `LIGHTRAG_API_PREFIX`.&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable `LIGHTRAG_API_PREFIX` is set to `/site01` in `site01.env`.&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable `LIGHTRAG_API_PREFIX` is set to `/site02` in `site02.env`.&lt;SEP&gt;"The text discusses the LIGHTRAG_API_PREFIX, which is an environment variable that sets the API prefix for the application.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-900da8eeab3b8744fbf99eb48a223646&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ff6c169abcd9da4c26e2eca92a0f7ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8695c3b8cfc1cc28382a176ac4d0e7ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eefa10d662229bd1054dbd21eaf6d102&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7149569405d52b329c2d9c690f051dd</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAX_EXTRACTION_RECORDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"VARIABLE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"MAX_EXTRACTION_RECORDS is a configuration in Settings for document indexing section."&lt;SEP&gt;"MAX_EXTRACTION_RECORDS is commented out, indicating it is not set for document indexing settings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e</data>
</node>
