  <data key="d3">"ENVIRONMENT VARIABLE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"A dedicated workspace environment variable 'MILVUS_WORKSPACE' is provided for Milvus.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `MILVUS_WORKSPACE` environment variable is used to override the common `WORKSPACE` environment variable configuration for Milvus."&lt;SEP&gt;"Storage-specific workspace environment variables include `MILVUS_WORKSPACE`."</data>
