<node id="&quot;NEO4J&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"DATABASE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"For high-performance graph database requirements, Neo4j is recommended over Apache AGE.&lt;SEP&gt;"LightRAG dynamically installs `neo4j` as a storage backend package.&lt;SEP&gt;"LightRAG dynamically installs `neo4j` as a storage backend package."&lt;SEP&gt;"Neo4j is a supported graph database by LightRAG.&lt;SEP&gt;"Neo4j is a supported storage solution by LightRAG."&lt;SEP&gt;"The default workspace for Neo4j is `base` when no workspace is configured."&lt;SEP&gt;"Neo4j is a supported storage solution by LightRAG."&lt;SEP&gt;"The default workspace for Neo4j is 'base' without configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;"Neo4j has graph storage set to `base`."&lt;SEP&gt;"Neo4j is a database that is used as a storage solution for the LightRAG project."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1417f2fecf74afcbf4d69be846fd679a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a95e21c3d4aa9dd77f673c11a10f2f2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44dde1b8fa9d74e9edbda4a6a1d22019&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-282ce1c61fc13efc3e86b9d5f4e51547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99142de25f745182f551fb22af5fa5ea</data>
</node>
