  <data key="d4">"A user-editable config for a local Redis container is managed and adjusted without losing manual edits.&lt;SEP&gt;"LightRAG dynamically installs `redis` as a storage backend package.&lt;SEP&gt;"LightRAG dynamically installs `redis` as a storage backend package."&lt;SEP&gt;"Redis is a supported in-memory data structure store by LightRAG.&lt;SEP&gt;"Redis is a supported storage solution by LightRAG."&lt;SEP&gt;"Redis is a supported storage solution by LightRAG."&lt;SEP&gt;"Recommended Redis configuration is given."&lt;SEP&gt;"Redis is supported as a KV storage for LightRAG.</data>
