</node>
<node id="&quot;VLM_PROCESS_ENABLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The VLM_PROCESS_ENABLE option is set to false, indicating it is not enabled."&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_PROCESS_ENABLE is a configuration in Optional VLM configuration for documents using i/t/e("hyper-relation"&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_PROCESS_ENABLE is a configuration parameter that enables the VLM (Vision and Language Model) processing feature in LightRAG. "&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_PROCESS_ENABLE is set to false, indicating that the VLM process is disabled.&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_PROCESS_ENABLE is set to false."&lt;SEP&gt;"The parameter VLM_PROCESS_ENABLE is set to false."&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_PROCESS_ENABLE is set to 'false' for optional VLM configuration settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_PROCESS_ENABLE must be true to enable multimodal options.&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_PROCESS_ENABLE is set to true, indicating that multimodal analysis is enabled.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-724331b1e2f5105ca6162abeddd355d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0ff5c99c56fa54fe27e56cb06863931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f3acc7d1050e16d5cc8de39fec3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8286dc1e92acbe46895a3e4b4adbe05d</data>
</node>
