<node id="&quot;VLM_LLM_MODEL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The VLM_LLM_MODEL parameter determines which Language Model to use with the Vision and Language Model (VLM) processing. "&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_LLM_MODEL is a configuration parameter that specifies the LLM (Language Model) to use for VLM processing. "&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_LLM_MODEL is set to gpt-4o, a model used in the VLM process."&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_LLM_MODEL is set to gpt-4o, indicating the specific version of the gpt model used for the VLM process.&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_LLM_MODEL is set to gpt-4o, specifying the language model to use for the VLM process.&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_LLM_MODEL is set to gpt-4o.&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_LLM_MODEL is set to gpt-5-mini in the example."&lt;SEP&gt;"The parameter VLM_LLM_MODEL is set to gpt-4o.&lt;SEP&gt;"The parameter VLM_LLM_MODEL is set to gpt-4o."&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_LLM_MODEL is commented out, indicating it is not set for optional VLM configuration settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_LLM_MODEL is set to gpt-4o.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-724331b1e2f5105ca6162abeddd355d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-280dedf626baee86fc0d61cdd836e6ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f3acc7d1050e16d5cc8de39fec3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0ff5c99c56fa54fe27e56cb06863931</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RERANKING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Add reranking to improve query quality after the minimal Docker run.&lt;SEP&gt;"Reranking is a feature that improves query results. "&lt;SEP&gt;"Reranking query-recalled chunks can enhance retrieval quality by re-ordering documents based on an optimized relevance scoring model."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reranking can be enabled or disabled on a per-query basis for optional settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reranking can be enabled or disabled on a per-query basis."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c19f3acc7d1050e16d5cc8de39fec3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44dde1b8fa9d74e9edbda4a6a1d22019&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7149569405d52b329c2d9c690f051dd</data>
</node>
