  <data key="d3">"PARAMETER"</data>
  <data key="d4">"MINERU_MODEL_VERSION is a configuration parameter that defines the model version to use with the MinerU API. "&lt;SEP&gt;"MINERU_MODEL_VERSION is set to vlm, indicating the model version used by MinerU parser.</data>
