</node>
<node id="&quot;SERVER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"SYSTEM"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The server can use different models for different stages without changing client APIs. Four roles are supported: EXTRACT, KEYWORD, QUERY, and VLM."&lt;SEP&gt;"The server logs the WebUI asset mount at startup.&lt;SEP&gt;"The server will skip the WebUI mount and redirect paths.&lt;SEP&gt;"The server will skip the WebUI mount due to the absence of the frontend.&lt;SEP&gt;"The server will skip the WebUI mount.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-280dedf626baee86fc0d61cdd836e6ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eefa10d662229bd1054dbd21eaf6d102</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHUNK_R_SEPARATORS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"CHUNK_R_SEPARATORS is a configuration in Settings for document indexing section."&lt;SEP&gt;"Strategy-specific variable for chunking with separators for `R` type chunks."&lt;SEP&gt;"CHUNK_R_SEPARATORS is commented out, indicating it is not set for document indexing settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Strategy-specific variable for chunker configuration that defines separators for `R` chunks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84523726bee4688a44b0a4ac3253a74c</data>
