  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"PARAMETER"</data>
  <data key="d4">"MINERU_IS_OCR is a configuration parameter that indicates whether OCR (Optical Character Recognition) should be used with the MinerU API. "&lt;SEP&gt;"MINERU_IS_OCR is set to false, indicating OCR is not used with MinerU parser.</data>
