<node id="&quot;OLLAMA-COMPATIBLE INTERFACE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"INTERFACE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"LightRAG Server provides an Ollama-compatible interface.&lt;SEP&gt;"The LightRAG Server provides an Ollama-compatible interface, which aims to emulate LightRAG as an Ollama chat model, allowing AI chat bots to access LightRAG easily."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8286dc1e92acbe46895a3e4b4adbe05d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;QUERY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Final answers, bypass queries, and Ollama-compatible chat responses."&lt;SEP&gt;"QUERY role uses the OpenAI official API, gpt-5.4, with a separate API key.&lt;SEP&gt;"The query stage, used to produce the final answer based on recalled content. A high-quality model with thinking mode enabled is recommended."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-082eb07a755d44999510e8f240806102&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2222a5f74e1118344a0513e7d693837a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-280dedf626baee86fc0d61cdd836e6ac</data>
