<node id="&quot;COMMAND-LINE ARGUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Command-line arguments are used to specify different server listening ports and workspaces for each instance when starting multiple LightRAG instances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Command-line arguments can modify `.env` file configurations.&lt;SEP&gt;"Command-line arguments specify different server listening ports and workspaces.&lt;SEP&gt;"Different command-line arguments are used to start multiple instances in the same directory.&lt;SEP&gt;"The command-line arguments to start instance 1 are `lightrag-server --port 9621 --workspace space1` and for instance 2 are `lightrag-server --port 9622 --workspace space2`."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9a514646a651da9026d7f8eb73aa2f08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7149569405d52b329c2d9c690f051dd</data>
