<node id="&quot;OPEN WEBUI&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"SOFTWARE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"A screenshot is provided from Open WebUI, showing its interface.&lt;SEP&gt;"Open WebUI employs an LLM for session title and keyword generation tasks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Open WebUI is an AI chat bot that can access LightRAG easily through the Ollama-compatible interface.&lt;SEP&gt;"Open WebUI supports Ollama and can access LightRAG through Ollama-compatible interfaces."&lt;SEP&gt;"Open WebUI uses an LLM for session title and session keyword generation tasks. It forwards session-related requests to the underlying LLM using the Ollama chat completion API.&lt;SEP&gt;"Open WebUI can be used to connect to LightRAG.&lt;SEP&gt;"Open WebUI can switch the model to a normal LLM without using the `/bypass` prefix.&lt;SEP&gt;"Open WebUI uses a Large Language Model (LLM) to generate session titles and keywords. "&lt;SEP&gt;"Open WebUI uses an LLM for session title and session keyword generation tasks. It forwards session-related requests to the underlying LLM using the Ollama chat completion API.&lt;SEP&gt;"This allows Open WebUI to access LightRAG easily.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8286dc1e92acbe46895a3e4b4adbe05d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e07113c82d8f800d43e240dceb9a4230&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1417f2fecf74afcbf4d69be846fd679a</data>
</node>
