  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Contains the full routing syntax, supported extensions, parser cache behavior, chunker configuration, concurrency rules, and Python SDK differences."&lt;SEP&gt;"Document detailing the full routing syntax, supported extensions, parser cache behavior, chunker configuration, concurrency rules, and Python SDK differences.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-84523726bee4688a44b0a4ac3253a74c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VLM_MAX_IMAGE_BYTES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"PARAMETER"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The parameter VLM_MAX_IMAGE_BYTES is set to 5242880.&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_MAX_IMAGE_BYTES is commented out, indicating it is not set for optional VLM configuration settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_MAX_IMAGE_BYTES is set to 5242880, indicating the maximum number of image bytes.&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_MAX_IMAGE_BYTES is set to 5242880, which is the maximum number of bytes for images processed by the VLM.&lt;SEP&gt;"VLM_MAX_IMAGE_BYTES is set to 5242880.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0ff5c99c56fa54fe27e56cb06863931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e</data>
</node>
