<node id="&quot;NGINX&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Nginx is a reverse proxy software used to configure `client_max_body_size` for the `/documents/upload` endpoint to handle large file uploads."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nginx is used as a reverse proxy in front of LightRAG Server."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nginx will reject files larger than 1MB without the configuration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nginx will reject files larger than 1MB (the default limit) with a `413 Request Entity Too Large` error before the request reaches LightRAG."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nginx is a web server software used in the configuration described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"No nginx is required in this setup.&lt;SEP&gt;"No nginx is used in this setup."&lt;SEP&gt;"Production nginx is used to strip `/site01/` before forwarding to the backend.&lt;SEP&gt;"Production nginx strips the `/site01/` prefix before forwarding to the backend.&lt;SEP&gt;"nginx is mentioned as a reverse proxy technology that can be used in the setup."&lt;SEP&gt;"nginx strips /site01/ and forwards /documents/foo to the backend.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9a514646a651da9026d7f8eb73aa2f08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f50a1a569536dcf7b4109c246e92d1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8695c3b8cfc1cc28382a176ac4d0e7ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-900da8eeab3b8744fbf99eb48a223646</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SURROUNDING_LEADING_MAX_TOKENS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"SURROUNDING_LEADING_MAX_TOKENS is commented out, indicating it is not set for optional VLM configuration settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"SURROUNDING_LEADING_MAX_TOKENS is set to 2000, indicating the maximum number of leading tokens.&lt;SEP&gt;"SURROUNDING_LEADING_MAX_TOKENS is set to 2000, which is the maximum number of leading tokens to consider for the VLM process.&lt;SEP&gt;"SURROUNDING_LEADING_MAX_TOKENS is set to 2000.&lt;SEP&gt;"The parameter SURROUNDING_LEADING_MAX_TOKENS is set to 2000.&lt;SEP&gt;"This is an environment variable that limits the number of leading tokens in surrounding content.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0ff5c99c56fa54fe27e56cb06863931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0457e4c69abfc4709a265a8f9f349adb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e</data>
</node>
