</node>
<node id="&quot;MAX_ASYNC_RERANK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"VARIABLE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"MAX_ASYNC_RERANK falls back to MAX_ASYNC_LLM when unset, with MAX_ASYNC as a deprecated alias."&lt;SEP&gt;"MAX_ASYNC_RERANK is commented out, indicating it is not set for optional reranker configuration settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"MAX_ASYNC_RERANK is commented out, indicating it is not set for reranker configuration settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"MAX_ASYNC_RERANK is set to '4'."&lt;SEP&gt;"MAX_ASYNC_RERANK is set to 4, indicating the maximum number of asynchronous reranks.&lt;SEP&gt;"MAX_ASYNC_RERANK is set to 4, which limits the number of concurrent reranker calls.&lt;SEP&gt;"MAX_ASYNC_RERANK is set to 4."&lt;SEP&gt;"The parameter MAX_ASYNC_RERANK is set to 4.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0ff5c99c56fa54fe27e56cb06863931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e</data>
</node>
