<node id="&quot;RERANK_TIMEOUT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"VARIABLE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"RERANK_TIMEOUT has an independent default value."&lt;SEP&gt;"RERANK_TIMEOUT is set to 30, indicating the timeout for reranks.&lt;SEP&gt;"RERANK_TIMEOUT is set to 30."&lt;SEP&gt;"RERANK_TIMEOUT is set to an empty string, indicating there is no timeout specified for reranker calls.&lt;SEP&gt;"RERANK_TIMEOUT is set to an empty string.&lt;SEP&gt;"RERANK_TIMEOUT has an independent default, as reranker requests are usually shorter than LLM generation requests."&lt;SEP&gt;"RERANK_TIMEOUT is commented out, indicating it is not set for optional reranker configuration settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"RERANK_TIMEOUT is commented out, indicating it is not set for reranker configuration settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"RERANK_TIMEOUT is set to '30'."&lt;SEP&gt;"The parameter RERANK_TIMEOUT is set to 30.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0ff5c99c56fa54fe27e56cb06863931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e</data>
