  <data key="d3">"ENVIRONMENT VARIABLE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Overrides the role model name.&lt;SEP&gt;"QUERY_LLM_MODEL is a configuration in LLM Configuration section."&lt;SEP&gt;"QUERY_LLM_MODEL is set to gpt-5 in the example."&lt;SEP&gt;"QUERY_LLM_MODEL is set to gpt-5.4.&lt;SEP&gt;"QUERY_LLM_MODEL set to gpt-5 for Same Provider, Change the Model and Tune Options.&lt;SEP&gt;"QUERY_LLM_MODEL set to gpt-5 for Same Provider, Only Change the Model.</data>
