<node id="&quot;STARTUP DIRECTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Copying `env.example` to the startup directory and renaming it to `.env` applies the configuration to the LightRAG Server.&lt;SEP&gt;"Please copy the file to the startup directory and rename it to `.env`.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `.env` file is placed in the startup directory to enable running multiple LightRAG instances with distinct configurations.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `.env` file must be placed in the startup directory when starting LightRAG.&lt;SEP&gt;"Please copy `env.example` to the startup directory and rename it to `.env`.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `.env` configuration file must be placed in the startup directory when starting LightRAG.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `env.example` file should be copied to the startup directory.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-021f97620f79cb0c99aad301145dfec1</data>
</node>
