<node id="&quot;WEBUI&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"SYSTEM"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Browsing `https://host.example.com/site01/webui/` shows site01's WebUI.&lt;SEP&gt;"Failed files can be reprocessed from the WebUI.&lt;SEP&gt;"The WebUI is the user interface for interacting with the LightRAG service. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The WebUI is available at `/webui`.&lt;SEP&gt;"The WebUI is mounted at `/webui` for access.&lt;SEP&gt;"The WebUI is always mounted at /webui and is reused by every instance of LightRAG.&lt;SEP&gt;"The WebUI is intended to be disabled entirely.&lt;SEP&gt;"The WebUI is mounted at `/webui` on the server side.&lt;SEP&gt;"The author wants to disable the WebUI entirely.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-900da8eeab3b8744fbf99eb48a223646&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ff6c169abcd9da4c26e2eca92a0f7ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84523726bee4688a44b0a4ac3253a74c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eefa10d662229bd1054dbd21eaf6d102&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7149569405d52b329c2d9c690f051dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19f3acc7d1050e16d5cc8de39fec3a4</data>
</node>
