<node id="&quot;BEDROCK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ENDPOINT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Backend that exposes the LightRAG REST API surface.&lt;SEP&gt;"Bedrock ignores `LLM_BINDING_API_KEY` and `EMBEDDING_BINDING_API_KEY`.&lt;SEP&gt;"The LightRAG Server supports bedrock as an LLM backend.&lt;SEP&gt;"The LightRAG Server supports bedrock as an embedding backend.&lt;SEP&gt;"Bedrock ignores `LLM_BINDING_API_KEY` and `EMBEDDING_BINDING_API_KEY`.&lt;SEP&gt;"One of the supported backends that expose the LightRAG REST API surface.&lt;SEP&gt;"bedrock is a supported LLM backend.&lt;SEP&gt;"bedrock is a supported embedding backend.&lt;SEP&gt;"Bedrock endpoint uses `{ROLE}_LLM_BINDING_HOST` as `endpoint_url`.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2222a5f74e1118344a0513e7d693837a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8286dc1e92acbe46895a3e4b4adbe05d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a5f058377b951c53da07f784f3944ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84523726bee4688a44b0a4ac3253a74c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOOGLE GEMINI&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"SERVICE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Google Gemini can be targeted by setting specific parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;"Google Gemini requires specific settings to be targeted, including the `LLM_BINDING` and `LLM_MODEL` parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;"Google Gemini is a service that can be targeted for configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;"When targeting Google Gemini, set `LLM_BINDING=gemini` and choose a model such as `LLM_MODEL=gemini-flash-latest`.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-021f97620f79cb0c99aad301145dfec1</data>
</node>
