<node id="&quot;LIGHTRAG_API_KEY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"If the upstream requires `LIGHTRAG_API_KEY`, log in via the dev SPA exactly as in production.&lt;SEP&gt;"LIGHTRAG_API_KEY is set to 'your-secure-api-key-here-123', indicating the secure API key for LightRAG API.&lt;SEP&gt;"The parameter LIGHTRAG_API_KEY is set to your-secure-api-key-here-123.&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable `LIGHTRAG_API_KEY` is set to `site01-secret` in `site01.env`.&lt;SEP&gt;"The environment variable `LIGHTRAG_API_KEY` is set to `site02-secret` in `site02.env`.</data>
