  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"System environment variables are overridden by the `.env` file variables.&lt;SEP&gt;"System environment variables are used by the server.&lt;SEP&gt;"System environment variables have higher precedence than `.env` file settings when the server starts, allowing system-wide configurations to override local ones.&lt;SEP&gt;"The LightRAG Server loads environment variables from `.env` into the system environment variables during startup, which influences the server's configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;"The server loads environment variables from the `.env` file into the system environment variables during startup, which influences the server's configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;"The LightRAG Server loads environment variables from `.env` into system environment variables.&lt;SEP&gt;"The LightRAG Server will also load system environment variables.</data>
