</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The top level is a dict container of the form `{&quot;version&quot;: &quot;1.0&quot;, &quot;equations&quot;: { &lt;id&gt;: &lt;item&gt;, ... }}`, **keyed by the `id` field** for lookup by id. Each item looks like:&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
