  <data key="d2">chunk-0457e4c69abfc4709a265a8f9f349adb</data>
</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Inline equations (those continuous with the body, as `&lt;equation format=&quot;latex&quot;&gt;…&lt;/equation&gt;`) **are not** saved to equations.json; they remain only in the blocks text without an `id` &quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
