</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;`doc_id` | `&quot;doc-&lt;md5&gt;&quot;` | Global document ID. Sidecar item IDs (`im-/tb-/eq-`) use the hash portion of `doc_id` with the `doc-` prefix removed, in order to shorten the placeholder tags embedded in body text. &quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
