</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;During the parsing stage, the content extraction engine (native/mineru/docling) is **only** responsible for generating &quot;objective&quot; fields such as `blockid / heading / content / surrounding&quot;;&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
