<node id="&quot;BLOCKID&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"A blockid is a unique identifier for a block, used for tracing its location in the sidecar.&lt;SEP&gt;"A blockid is a unique identifier for a block, used to reference its location within the document and sidecar files.&lt;SEP&gt;"Blockid is part of the sidecar. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The `blockid` field contains a globally unique Block ID.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `blockid` field points to the content line that produced the drawing. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The `blockid` field points to the content line that produced this drawing in the document.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `blockid` is a unique identifier for content blocks in the file.&lt;SEP&gt;"The blockid is computed using the md5 hash of the document id, block index, heading, and content. "&lt;SEP&gt;"Content typically contains a blockid "&lt;SEP&gt;"Optional blockid present for traceability "</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a79bee86d871fa85d9e457899f3ff418&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0457e4c69abfc4709a265a8f9f349adb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f62767a155c127d2e19bb2a763d570c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1394c48f6affe43ef3462e870a7090e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6df28f5232d5c31b9f64164c61a08e65</data>
</node>
