<node id="&quot;HEADING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Content typically contains the heading "&lt;SEP&gt;"Each element contains heading metadata "&lt;SEP&gt;"The `heading` field indicates the section heading the drawing belongs to.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `heading` field indicates the top-most-level heading of the section containing the content.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `heading` field is the section heading the drawing belongs to. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The heading is part of the blockid computation. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The pre-pass guarantees the heading is never detached from its child content.</data>
