  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `type` column is part of the shared column schema.&lt;SEP&gt;"The `type` field indicates the block type is `content`.&lt;SEP&gt;"The communities list includes a type field which specifies the data type of the community.&lt;SEP&gt;"The community_reports list includes a type field which specifies the data type of the report.&lt;SEP&gt;"The covariates list includes a type field which specifies the nature of the claim type.&lt;SEP&gt;"The identifier fields include a type field which specifies the data type of the identifier.</data>
