  <data key="d4">"- **docling**: `label="title"` → level 1, `label="section_header"` → `item.level + 1` (default level 2), likewise maintaining the parent chain."&lt;SEP&gt;"Content typically contains the heading level "&lt;SEP&gt;"The `level` field is an integer indicating the level of the heading in the document outline.&lt;SEP&gt;"This checks for consistency in `level` of adjacent clauses for merging requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The communities list includes a level field which is the depth of the community in the hierarchy.&lt;SEP&gt;"The community_reports list includes a level field which is the level of the community the report applies to.</data>
