<node id="&quot;CHUNK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"A chunk is a portion of the document that is processed separately, often for indexing or analysis purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;"A chunk is a portion of the document that is processed separately.&lt;SEP&gt;"Chunks are used to trace back to their location in the sidecar. "&lt;SEP&gt;"Chunk boundaries are aligned with the document's native semantic boundaries.&lt;SEP&gt;"Chunks are aligned with the document's native semantic boundaries.&lt;SEP&gt;"The output is a chunk list "</data>
