<node id="&quot;SIDECAR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"A sidecar is a supplementary file that contains metadata and additional information about the document blocks.&lt;SEP&gt;"Sidecars are the only reliable source of truth for the pipeline processes.&lt;SEP&gt;"The sidecar is a separate file that contains additional information about the document blocks.&lt;SEP&gt;"The sidecar is used to locate the chunks. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The sidecar is rebuilt from the existing raw directory."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a79bee86d871fa85d9e457899f3ff418&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0e2827f0656f23647a5ad5b252099d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1394c48f6affe43ef3462e870a7090e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33d111aa7def535c2ef43b93f5b747d7</data>
