<node id="&quot;LIGHTRAG SIDECAR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"FILE FORMAT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The document describes the LightRAG Sidecar file format, which is used by content parsing engines to output data.&lt;SEP&gt;"The format is documented to make it convenient for developers to write their own content parsing engines.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-33d111aa7def535c2ef43b93f5b747d7</data>
