<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Milvus index parameters can be configured through `vector_db_storage_cls_kwargs`, which is the **recommended approach** for framework integration scenarios (e.g., when using RAGAnything or other frameworks built on top of LightRAG).&quot;">
