<node id="&quot;VECTOR_DB_STORAGE_CLS_KWARGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"DICTIONARY"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Milvus index parameters can be configured through `vector_db_storage_cls_kwargs`."&lt;SEP&gt;"vector_db_storage_cls_kwargs is a code object that represents the configuration parameters for the vector database storage class."&lt;SEP&gt;"The keyword arguments vector_db_storage_cls_kwargs are used in the LightRAG project.&lt;SEP&gt;"vector_db_storage_cls_kwargs is a dictionary that contains additional parameters for the vector database, such as setting the threshold for nodes and relations retrieval. It has a default value of `cosine_better_than_threshold: 0.2` and can be changed by the environment variable COSINE_THRESHOLD."&lt;SEP&gt;"vector_db_storage_cls_kwargs is a dictionary that includes additional parameters for the vector database. These parameters are used to configure how nodes and relations are retrieved, such as setting a threshold for similarity.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9de68fb6438d36191c59a2bd51dc2410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c74b3a56df033faf9eedb477d804a55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a95e21c3d4aa9dd77f673c11a10f2f2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0019d86a98d6eeaac4d5a59a03aa2580</data>
</node>
