<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The result is a script that replaces the placeholder comment with `&lt;script&gt;window.__LIGHTRAG_CONFIG__ = {&quot;apiPrefix&quot;:&quot;…&quot;,&quot;webuiPrefix&quot;:&quot;…&quot;}&lt;/script&gt;`, computed from the configured `LIGHTRAG_API_PREFIX` (the in-app `/webui` mount is hardcoded server-side).&quot;">
