<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;This document explains how to run multiple isolated LightRAG instances behind one host using a reverse proxy (nginx, Traefik, Kubernetes Ingress, …), with one shared WebUI build reused by every instance. This setup is described as a single-server multi-site deployment.&quot;">
