</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;`table_chunk_role` is an internal field that does not survive into the final output, **but it continues to serve as a merging constraint in LevelMerge** (see §3.6.1).&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
