  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"There is a large table B that is part of the pattern "</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a78f97cbe007105c80acba2db42453d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SINGLE-ROW TABLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CODE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"A single-row table that exceeds the `target_max` limit without an anchor to split on."&lt;SEP&gt;"This scenario involves a single-row table that exceeds `target_max` with no anchor to split on, leading to R character splitting but still exceeding the limit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1f6e0884f12ea67e008e26e0216f0a4e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SCENARIO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Scenarios are listed in the table.&lt;SEP&gt;"The goal is decomposed into rules for tables, long blocks, and fine-grained sections.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b84c6dc4e56f32ef79bfc21440cf2ef4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfdc14720aca7f1c8740b02182c2b4d8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEFT BUDGET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The left budget is computed as `prev_budget = min(chunk_overlap_token_size, target_max - current token count of the left last slice)`."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a78f97cbe007105c80acba2db42453d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENFORCE_CHUNK_TOKEN_LIMIT_BEFORE_EMBEDDING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CODE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"This process does a final hard split before embedding to ensure no over-limit chunk is embedded into the vector store."&lt;SEP&gt;"This process enforces a final hard split before embedding to prevent over-limit chunks from being stored in the vector store."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1f6e0884f12ea67e008e26e0216f0a4e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OVERLAPS?&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"It indicates whether overlaps occur in the scenarios.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b84c6dc4e56f32ef79bfc21440cf2ef4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;R STRATEGY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"METHOD"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The R strategy is automatically degraded to when there is no sidecar or parse failure, while V strategy auto-degrades to R when there is no embedding model."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c57c83519f50b4e9e94ec0fa78d3401a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RIGHT BUDGET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The right budget is computed as `next_budget = min(chunk_overlap_token_size, target_max - current token count of the right first slice)`."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a78f97cbe007105c80acba2db42453d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PART 1&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CODE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"This checks if one `[part 1]` is seen after splitting an original content line into multiple pieces, and whether they were merged in LevelMerge without concatenating the main block's part suffix."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1f6e0884f12ea67e008e26e0216f0a4e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUDGET / MECHANISM&quot;">
