  <data key="d4">"It describes the effect served by the overlaps.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b84c6dc4e56f32ef79bfc21440cf2ef4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HEADING OUTLINE LEVEL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The P strategy uses heading outline level and `parent_headings` + table-row boundaries + anchors + hierarchy-aware merging for chunking."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c57c83519f50b4e9e94ec0fa78d3401a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MIDDLE SLICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Middle and last slices of the table lose the column names without the header row."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a78f97cbe007105c80acba2db42453d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIFFERENT `.BLOCKS.JSONL` CONTENT LINES (SECTION BOUNDARIES)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Different content lines do not overlap.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b84c6dc4e56f32ef79bfc21440cf2ef4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TABLE-ROW BOUNDARIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The P strategy prevents long-block re-splitting by considering table-row boundaries and heading levels, maintaining the structure of the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The P strategy uses heading outline level and `parent_headings` + table-row boundaries + anchors + hierarchy-aware merging for chunking."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c57c83519f50b4e9e94ec0fa78d3401a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-FIRST SLICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The header row is re-injected into the non-first slices' own `&lt;table&gt;`."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a78f97cbe007105c80acba2db42453d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLEAR SECTION BOUNDARIES, NO MIS-ATTRIBUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"EFFECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"It ensures clear section boundaries and no mis-attribution.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b84c6dc4e56f32ef79bfc21440cf2ef4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANCHORS&quot;">
