  <data key="d4">"The P strategy uses heading outline level and `parent_headings` + table-row boundaries + anchors + hierarchy-aware merging for chunking."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c57c83519f50b4e9e94ec0fa78d3401a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HEADER-BEARING TABLE&quot;">
