<node id="&quot;TITLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `title` column is the name of the document.&lt;SEP&gt;"`mineru`: detects headings by an item's `text_level &gt; 0` or `label` being `title` / `section_header`, using a heading_stack to maintain the parent chain."&lt;SEP&gt;"The communities list includes a title field which is the friendly name of the community.&lt;SEP&gt;"The community_reports list includes a title field which is the LM-generated title for the report.&lt;SEP&gt;"The documents list includes a title field which is the filename or title of the document.</data>
