  <data key="d4">"The command 'python -m lightrag.parser.cli' is used to force re-parse the file, clearing the raw directory and re-downloading the content."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f0e2827f0656f23647a5ad5b252099d6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARCHIVE_DOCX_SOURCE_AFTER_FULL_DOCS_SYNC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `archive_docx_source_after_full_docs_sync` is a no-op, preserving the source file.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f0e2827f0656f23647a5ad5b252099d6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RAW DIRECTORY EXISTS BUT SIDECAR CONTENT IS STILL STALE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ERROR"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The error 'Raw directory exists but sidecar content is still stale' occurs when the raw directory exists but the sidecar content is outdated.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f0e2827f0656f23647a5ad5b252099d6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGISTRY DISPATCH PATH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"It drives the same registry dispatch path as the pipeline worker."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-742706ba2caa2b3584f3a7dd55c34a82</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;--ENGINE DOCLING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OPTION"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The option '--engine docling' specifies the engine to use for parsing the file."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f0e2827f0656f23647a5ad5b252099d6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCLING REPORTS `PRODUCED ZERO BLOCKS`&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"ERROR"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The error 'docling reports `produced zero blocks`' occurs when docling produces zero blocks during parsing.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f0e2827f0656f23647a5ad5b252099d6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPECIFIED PARENT DIRECTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Artifacts land directly under the specified parent directory.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-742706ba2caa2b3584f3a7dd55c34a82</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;./INPUTS/WORKSPACE/SAMPLE.DOCX&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"FILE"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The file './inputs/workspace/sample.docx' is being parsed with the native engine and output to the custom directory."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f0e2827f0656f23647a5ad5b252099d6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;--FORCE-REPARSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OPTION"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The option '--force-reparse' is used to clear the raw directory and re-download the content, ensuring the sidecar is up-to-date.&lt;SEP&gt;"The option '--force-reparse' is used to force re-parse the file, clearing the raw directory and re-downloading the content."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f0e2827f0656f23647a5ad5b252099d6</data>
</node>
