  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"BOOLEAN"</data>
  <data key="d4">"enable_llm_cache is a boolean that indicates if LLM results should be stored in cache. If set to `TRUE`, repeated prompts will return cached responses, and the default is `TRUE`."&lt;SEP&gt;"enable_llm_cache is a boolean that indicates whether LLM results should be stored in cache. If set to `TRUE`, repeated prompts will return cached responses, improving efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c74b3a56df033faf9eedb477d804a55</data>
</node>
