</node>
<node id="&quot;UNDERCURRENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The competitive undercurrent that kept Alex alert is related to the shared commitment to discovery by Alex and Jordan, which is an unspoken rebellion against Cruz's narrowing vision of control and order. This undercurrent is also related to the tech that could change the game for all of them."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9bab9af02b0cc012a8a67a260719db75</data>
</node>
