  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Alex's alertness is due to the competitive undercurrent that is part of the shared commitment to discovery by Alex and Jordan, which is an unspoken rebellion against Cruz's narrowing vision of control and order. This alertness is also related to the tech that could change the game for all of them."</data>
