<node id="&quot;ENABLE_LLM_CACHE_FOR_ENTITY_EXTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"BOOLEAN"</data>
  <data key="d4">"enable_llm_cache_for_entity_extract is a boolean that indicates if LLM results for entity extraction should be stored in cache. It is good for beginners to debug their application, and the default is `TRUE`."&lt;SEP&gt;"enable_llm_cache_for_entity_extract is a boolean that indicates whether LLM results for entity extraction should be stored in cache. This is particularly useful for debugging and is set to `TRUE` by default.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c74b3a56df033faf9eedb477d804a55</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRANSFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Alex acknowledged a small transformation in the dynamics.&lt;SEP&gt;"The small transformation noted by Alex is barely perceptible but significant, indicating a change in the dynamics between the characters. It is related to the unspoken rebellion and the shared commitment to discovery by Alex and Jordan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6de5b0bd36ab38136d2c64b43d87067d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bab9af02b0cc012a8a67a260719db75</data>
