  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"GraphRAG 1.0 is a product mentioned in the blog post, designed to streamline ergonomics for developers and users."&lt;SEP&gt;"GraphRAG is moving to version 1.0, streamlining ergonomics.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9668f0aaf8a193726db60d41bb9b8742&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc6991d03ac28fb348468bf2d1c2d295</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GRAPHRAG&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"TOOL"</data>
  <data key="d4">"GraphRAG includes the ability to specify specific workflow steps, which is a feature of the software tool.&lt;SEP&gt;"GraphRAG is a software tool for discovering LLMs on narrative private data."&lt;SEP&gt;"GraphRAG is a software tool that unlocks LLM discovery on narrative private data."&lt;SEP&gt;"Users want to summarize their existing graph for query with GraphRAG, a software tool."&lt;SEP&gt;"The ':prog_name: graphrag' indicates the program or command is named 'graphrag'.&lt;SEP&gt;"The documentation includes the prog_name 'graphrag', which is likely the name of the program.&lt;SEP&gt;:prog_name: graphrag is mentioned in the documentation of the graphrag library.&lt;SEP&gt;"These definitions are in the python/graphrag/graphrag/model folder within the GraphRAG repository."&lt;SEP&gt;"GraphRAG is a software that can consume a lot of LLM resources and is recommended to start with the tutorial dataset for understanding how the system works."&lt;SEP&gt;"The section discusses the installation process for GraphRAG, which involves creating a project space and a Python virtual environment, and then installing the package itself."&lt;SEP&gt;"The text provides an example of using GraphRAG after installing it from PyPI (Python Package Index)."&lt;SEP&gt;"GraphRAG is a structured, hierarchical approach to Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Using GraphRAG with your data out of the box may not yield the best possible results, so it is recommended to fine-tune your prompts."&lt;SEP&gt;"GraphRAG is a software that supports several input formats for ingesting data.&lt;SEP&gt;"GraphRAG is a platform for our research into RAG indexing methods and producing optimal context window content for language models."&lt;SEP&gt;"The knowledge graph is constructed by graphrag."&lt;SEP&gt;"The knowledge graph is constructed by the tool graphrag."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-813bfd09c5663aba506972a834914fb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbc9cbe94e549538ada5a47127f63ede&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e8c003efcd580037bb1cdeb5a33b78f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71f126a1f713fce89f72bd739d4c81eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-640e5c41fd121c0003f70f439e8b3b48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b98dce4eef8d1a08af62b430c1fe835e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04e9a4e23946a2a3618f112c8e332247&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-753b54f11987ea184b7a7af0bb9e15ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9668f0aaf8a193726db60d41bb9b8742</data>
</node>
