  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"OBJECT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Users want to bring their own existing graph for query with GraphRAG."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-04e9a4e23946a2a3618f112c8e332247</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOCAL SEARCH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"METHOD"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Local Search is used for reasoning about specific entities by fanning-out to their neighbors and associated concepts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The example demonstrates using Local search for a more specific question about a particular character.&lt;SEP&gt;"You need to include text_units and embeddings for Local Search.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71f126a1f713fce89f72bd739d4c81eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-640e5c41fd121c0003f70f439e8b3b48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04e9a4e23946a2a3618f112c8e332247</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENTITIES AND RELATIONSHIPS PARQUET FILES&quot;">
