  <data key="d4">"The ':prog_name: graphrag' indicates the program or command is named 'graphrag'.&lt;SEP&gt;"The documentation includes a prog_name, which likely refers to the name of the program or command to be used.&lt;SEP&gt;:prog_name: graphrag is mentioned in the documentation of the graphrag library.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bbc9cbe94e549538ada5a47127f63ede</data>
</node>
