  <data key="d2">chunk-640e5c41fd121c0003f70f439e8b3b48</data>
</node>
<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Please refer to [Query Engine](query/overview.md) docs for detailed information about how to leverage our Local and Global search mechanisms for extracting meaningful insights from data after the Indexer has wrapped up execution.&quot;">
