<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Using _GraphRAG_ with your data out of the box may not yield the best possible results. We strongly recommend to fine-tune your prompts following the [Prompt Tuning Guide](prompt_tuning/overview.md) in our documentation.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">7.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71f126a1f713fce89f72bd739d4c81eb</data>
</node>
