<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Auto Tuning leverages your input data and LLM interactions to create domain-adapted prompts for the generation of the knowledge graph, which is an object that represents structured information about real-world entities and relationships in a graph format, and it is highly encouraged to run it as it will yield better results when executing an Index Run.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">8.0</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-37ac2e652be419ab7d9491e584ea178d</data>
