<node id="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The following step-by-step guide walks through the process to visualize a knowledge graph after it's been constructed by graphrag. Note that some of the settings recommended below are based on our own experience of what works well. Feel free to change and explore other settings for a better visualization experience!&quot;">
  <data key="d0">hyperedge</data>
  <data key="d1">16.0</data>
