  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"FORMAT"</data>
  <data key="d4">"The `graph.graphml` file is in the graphml format, a standard file format supported by many visualization tools."&lt;SEP&gt;"The `graph.graphml` file is in the graphml format, which is a standard file format.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-753b54f11987ea184b7a7af0bb9e15ee</data>
