  <data key="d0">entity</data>
  <data key="d3">"TOOL"</data>
  <data key="d4">"Gephi is recommended as a visualization tool that supports the graphml format.&lt;SEP&gt;"Gephi is the tool used to open and visualize the graph.&lt;SEP&gt;"The graph needs to be opened in Gephi to visualize it."&lt;SEP&gt;"We recommend trying Gephi, a visualization tool that supports the graphml format."</data>
