<edge source="&quot;GEMINI&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;All supported backends (`lollms`, `ollama`, `openai` / OpenAI-compatible, `azure_openai`, `bedrock`, and `gemini`) expose the same LightRAG REST API surface.&quot;">
