<edge source="&quot;GEMINI&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;| `gemini` | Supported, passed to the Google GenAI client through `{ROLE}_LLM_BINDING_HOST`; `DEFAULT_GEMINI_ENDPOINT` means using the SDK default endpoint. | AI Studio mode supports `{ROLE}_LLM_BINDING_API_KEY`. | Vertex AI is controlled by `GOOGLE_GENAI_USE_VERTEXAI`, `GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT`, `GOOGLE_CLOUD_LOCATION`, and `GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS`; all are process-level settings. &quot;">
