</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UV.LOCK&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Remember: `uv.lock` only changes when you run a command that tells it to. Keep it in sync with your project and commit it whenever it changes.">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-100681c982044751140d02d193a76196</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UV.LOCK&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Keep it in sync with your project and commit it whenever it changes.">
