<edge source="&quot;MILVUS&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;An in-memory database that persists data to the WORKING_DIR directory. Additionally, LightRAG supports a wide range of storage solutions including PostgreSQL, MongoDB, FAISS, Milvus, Qdrant, Neo4j, Memgraph, Redis, and OpenSearch. For detailed information on supported storage options, please refer to the storage section in the README.md file located in the root directory.&quot;">
