<edge source="&quot;SETUP WIZARD&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;**Important Note**: The embedding model and asymmetric embedding configuration must be determined before document indexing, and the same settings must be used during the query phase. For certain storage solutions (e.g., PostgreSQL), the vector dimension must be defined upon initial table creation. When changing the embedding model, embedding dimension, `EMBEDDING_ASYMMETRIC`, query/document prefixes, or provider task behavior, clear the existing LightRAG workspace/vector data and re-index the source files.">
