<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Each time `apipeline_process_enqueue_documents` starts up, it pulls all documents in `PARSING` / `ANALYZING` / `PROCESSING` / `PENDING` / `FAILED` to continue processing. The resume path **branches by &quot;whether content has been extracted&quot;**, ensuring that any document, regardless of its previous progress, has an idempotent result when resumed under the current `process_options`.&quot;" target="&quot;PARSING&quot;">
  <data key="d5">80.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f95d6aa1ada1a445751726c13f57d913</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Each time `apipeline_process_enqueue_documents` starts up, it pulls all documents in `PARSING` / `ANALYZING` / `PROCESSING` / `PENDING` / `FAILED` to continue processing. The resume path **branches by &quot;whether content has been extracted&quot;**, ensuring that any document, regardless of its previous progress, has an idempotent result when resumed under the current `process_options`.&quot;" target="&quot;ANALYZING&quot;">
  <data key="d5">80.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f95d6aa1ada1a445751726c13f57d913</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Each time `apipeline_process_enqueue_documents` starts up, it pulls all documents in `PARSING` / `ANALYZING` / `PROCESSING` / `PENDING` / `FAILED` to continue processing. The resume path **branches by &quot;whether content has been extracted&quot;**, ensuring that any document, regardless of its previous progress, has an idempotent result when resumed under the current `process_options`.&quot;" target="&quot;PROCESSING&quot;">
  <data key="d5">80.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f95d6aa1ada1a445751726c13f57d913</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Each time `apipeline_process_enqueue_documents` starts up, it pulls all documents in `PARSING` / `ANALYZING` / `PROCESSING` / `PENDING` / `FAILED` to continue processing. The resume path **branches by &quot;whether content has been extracted&quot;**, ensuring that any document, regardless of its previous progress, has an idempotent result when resumed under the current `process_options`.&quot;" target="&quot;PENDING&quot;">
  <data key="d5">80.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f95d6aa1ada1a445751726c13f57d913</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Each time `apipeline_process_enqueue_documents` starts up, it pulls all documents in `PARSING` / `ANALYZING` / `PROCESSING` / `PENDING` / `FAILED` to continue processing. The resume path **branches by &quot;whether content has been extracted&quot;**, ensuring that any document, regardless of its previous progress, has an idempotent result when resumed under the current `process_options`.&quot;" target="&quot;FAILED&quot;">
  <data key="d5">80.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f95d6aa1ada1a445751726c13f57d913</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Each time `apipeline_process_enqueue_documents` starts up, it pulls all documents in `PARSING` / `ANALYZING` / `PROCESSING` / `PENDING` / `FAILED` to continue processing. The resume path **branches by &quot;whether content has been extracted&quot;**, ensuring that any document, regardless of its previous progress, has an idempotent result when resumed under the current `process_options`.&quot;" target="&quot;PROCESS_OPTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d5">80.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f95d6aa1ada1a445751726c13f57d913</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Each time `apipeline_process_enqueue_documents` starts up, it pulls all documents in `PARSING` / `ANALYZING` / `PROCESSING` / `PENDING` / `FAILED` to continue processing. The resume path **branches by &quot;whether content has been extracted&quot;**, ensuring that any document, regardless of its previous progress, has an idempotent result when resumed under the current `process_options`.&quot;" target="&quot;APIPELINE_PROCESS_ENQUEUE_DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d5">80.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f95d6aa1ada1a445751726c13f57d913</data>
</edge>
