<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;| `file_path` | Basename of the filename (without directory), **preserves the original name provided by the user (including the square-bracket hint)**, e.g., `abc.[native-iet].docx` is written as-is. When no valid source is provided, it is saved as `unknown_source`. The filename hint is not stripped, so the management UI can &quot;" target="&quot;FILE_PATH&quot;">
