<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;- The process of resolving the stored document parser engine and the role of environment variables in tuning system parameters are highlighted. Environment variables control system behavior, with their values affecting the system's performance and functionality. These values are read at the construction of `LightRAG` and can be adjusted through `.env` or environment variables. &quot;" target="&quot;`.ENV`">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1d7fd65aa6723acd55b13afedde44866</data>
</edge>
