<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;U path — LightRAG mandates `canonical_basename` uniqueness within the same workspace (HTTP 409 on upload / enqueue), and combined with the pipeline's serialization per document, `*.docling_raw/` has no concurrent write conflicts and needs no extra locks.&quot;" target="&quot;WORKSPACE&quot;">
  <data key="d5">70.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-59fa2d582eb20bc136094483fb09d31c</data>
