<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;- The role of `MAX_PARALLEL_INSERT` as a worker pool size and semaphore cap is emphasized. It is the maximum number of concurrent documents that can be processed at the entity/relation extraction + ingest stage. This value serves as a limit for the concurrency level of the process stage.&quot;" target="&quot;WORKER POOL SIZE&quot;">
