<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The &quot;either side empty → skip&quot; semantics of `engine_version` / `endpoint_signature` is the same as MinerU §4.3: when the field was empty at manifest-write time (first parse without `DOCLING_ENGINE_VERSION` configured) or when the current environment variable is not set, the check is skipped for that item; adding the version number later does not automatically invalidate the historical cache; `LIGHTRAG_FORCE_REPARSE_DOCLING=true` is needed to trigger.&quot;" target="&quot;MINERU&quot;">
  <data key="d5">70.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-59fa2d582eb20bc136094483fb09d31c</data>
</edge>
