<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;For ordinary upload, text APIs, and core enqueue APIs, as long as a file with the same name already exists in `doc_status` — whether that record is currently `PENDING`, `PARSING`, `ANALYZING`, `PROCESSING`, `FAILED`, or `PROCESSED` — the same-name file is considered a duplicate.&quot;" target="&quot;TEXT APIS&quot;">
