<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;&gt; Within an enqueue batch (the same `apipeline_enqueue_documents` call), basename and content_hash dedup are also performed; on hit, subsequent entries are written as `FAILED` directly and marked with `existing_status=batch_duplicate`. Basename dedup only applies to valid filenames; `unknown_source`, `no-file-path`, and empty sources only participate in content-hash dedup." target="&quot;EXISTING_STATUS=BATCH_DUPLICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
