<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Keep the legacy file-processing behavior: All files are processed using the legacy document parsing and chunking strategy. Either leave `LIGHTRAG_PARSER` unconfigured, or set it to the following value: `&lt;br&gt;` ```bash&lt;br&gt;`LIGHTRAG_PARSER=*:legacy-F`&lt;br&gt;````&quot;" target="&quot;LEGACY FILE-PROCESSING BEHAVIOR&quot;">
