<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;On top of the basic deployment, it is recommended to additionally enable two MinerU **server-side** features for your local MinerU. Both modify MinerU container-side configuration (the in-container `mineru.json` and the official `compose.yaml`), and do not involve any LightRAG env variable; title-level correction additionally requires an available LLM API. &quot;" target="&quot;VLLM STARTUP PRELOAD&quot;">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-329eac639a865519f1557ce9dc303a63</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;On top of the basic deployment, it is recommended to additionally enable two MinerU **server-side** features for your local MinerU. Both modify MinerU container-side configuration (the in-container `mineru.json` and the official `compose.yaml`), and do not involve any LightRAG env variable; title-level correction additionally requires an available LLM API. &quot;" target="&quot;TITLE-LEVEL CORRECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-329eac639a865519f1557ce9dc303a63</data>
</edge>
