<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Enable multimodal processing capability: Enabling multimodal processing requires the `MinerU` file parsing service and a `VLM` vision recognition model. Use `Native` to parse `docx` files; use `MinerU` to parse `pdf`, `office`, and various image files. All of the above files have image (i), table (t), and equation (e) modality analysis enabled and are paired with the `P` chunking strategy. Other documents fall back to the legacy content extractor paired with the `R` chunking strategy. `&lt;br&gt;` ```bash&lt;br&gt;`LIGHTRAG_PARSER=*:native-iteP,*:mineru-iteP,*:legacy-R`&lt;br&gt;```` `&lt;br&gt;` `VLM_PROCESS_ENABLE=true` `&lt;br&gt;` `VLM_LLM_MODEL=kimi-k2.6` `&lt;br&gt;` `MINERU_API_MODE=local` `&lt;br&gt;` `MINERU_LOCAL_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:8000` &quot;" target="&quot;LEGACY CONTENT EXTRACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d5">70.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-502fd83a7f153d429f3536ae34c05bb2</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Enable multimodal processing capability: Enabling multimodal processing requires the `MinerU` file parsing service and a `VLM` vision recognition model. Use `Native` to parse `docx` files; use `MinerU` to parse `pdf`, `office`, and various image files. All of the above files have image (i), table (t), and equation (e) modality analysis enabled and are paired with the `P` chunking strategy. Other documents fall back to the legacy content extractor paired with the `R` chunking strategy. `&lt;br&gt;` ```bash&lt;br&gt;`LIGHTRAG_PARSER=*:native-iteP,*:mineru-iteP,*:legacy-R`&lt;br&gt;```` `&lt;br&gt;` `VLM_PROCESS_ENABLE=true` `&lt;br&gt;` `VLM_LLM_MODEL=kimi-k2.6` `&lt;br&gt;` `MINERU_API_MODE=local` `&lt;br&gt;` `MINERU_LOCAL_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:8000` &quot;" target="&quot;CHUNKING STRATEGY R&quot;">
  <data key="d5">70.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-502fd83a7f153d429f3536ae34c05bb2</data>
</edge>
