<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;- Merge priority: engine parameters resolve for the **final engine** — a rule's engine parameters are dropped when a filename hint selects a different (usable) engine.&quot;" target="&quot;MERGE PRIORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d5">80.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-04c25eb38b88488839f25538326154e2</data>
</edge>
