<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Common combination examples: `&lt;br&gt;` ```bash&lt;br&gt;`LIGHTRAG_PARSER=pdf:mineru-R,docx:native-ietP,*:legacy-R&lt;br&gt;`&lt;br&gt;`MINERU_API_MODE=local&lt;br&gt;`&lt;br&gt;`MINERU_LOCAL_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:8000&lt;br&gt;`&lt;br&gt;`DOCLING_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:5001`&lt;br&gt;`&lt;br&gt;`my-proposal.[native-iet].docx   # Use the native engine, enable drawing/table/equation analysis&lt;br&gt;`&lt;br&gt;`my-memo.[native-R!].docx        # Use the native engine, recursive semantic chunking, disable knowledge graph construction`&lt;br&gt;````&quot;" target="&quot;COMMON COMBINATION EXAMPLES&quot;">
