</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;- Forced refresh: first call `/documents/{doc_id}` to delete the old document, then upload the same-named new file. This method ensures that the system always uses the most recent version of the document." target="&quot;DOCUMENT_VERSION_CONTROL&quot;">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
