<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;- Avoid duplicate uploads/conversions. When parsing the same file again, the source file's hash + size is first validated against `_manifest.json`; on hit, the upload / poll / download against docling-serve is skipped, and the local `.json` is fed directly through DoclingIRBuilder → SidecarWriter.&quot;" target="&quot;_MANIFEST.JSON&quot;">
