<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The lock does **not** cover the `request_pending` nudge (outside the lock; only briefly takes `pipeline_status_lock`), and does **not** block the `get_docs_by_statuses` read of the processing loop (which goes through `doc_status`'s own concurrent reads — a KV-level atomic with the enqueue writes, not contending for the same lock). Lock order: `enqueue_serialize → pipeline_status_lock`; no deadlock path." target="&quot;PIPELINE&quot;">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5b23b4175c6c0f4dc09cf75abdbc8b03</data>
</edge>
