<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;is incrementally filled in; when changing `F/R/V/P`, chunks and graph are rebuilt; when changing `!`, KG construction is stopped or restored. Engine changes are considered a &quot;major change&quot;, uniformly handled by delete + re-upload, not implicitly happening on the resume path.&quot;" target="&quot;CHUNKS&quot;">
