<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;After modification, **subsequent enqueues** get the new defaults; already-enqueued documents keep the snapshot from their enqueue moment (see the three layers of semantic guarantee in §3.3). This is tier 1 of §3.3's priority chain: &quot;`addon_params[&quot;chunker&quot;]` explicit value&quot;, winning everything." target="&quot;SUBSEQUENT ENQUEUES&quot;">
