<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Parse queues are created dynamically from the registry's `ParserSpec.queue_group` (one registry snapshot per batch): the built-in native/mineru/docling each own a group, legacy shares the native pool (local, no network), and a third-party engine may declare its own group with a custom worker count (see `docs/ThirdPartyParser-zh.md`).&quot;" target="&quot;PARSE QUEUES&quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1d7fd65aa6723acd55b13afedde44866</data>
</edge>
