<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;At enqueue time, `resolve_stored_document_parser_engine` puts each document into the corresponding parse queue based on its `parser_engine` (from `LIGHTRAG_PARSER` defaults or the filename hint); the parse queues are completely non-blocking with respect to each other — mineru saturation does not slow down docling or native. &quot;" target="&quot;RESOLVE_STORED_DOCUMENT_PARSER_ENGINE&quot;">
  <data key="d5">180.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1d7fd65aa6723acd55b13afedde44866</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;At enqueue time, `resolve_stored_document_parser_engine` puts each document into the corresponding parse queue based on its `parser_engine` (from `LIGHTRAG_PARSER` defaults or the filename hint); the parse queues are completely non-blocking with respect to each other — mineru saturation does not slow down docling or native. &quot;" target="&quot;PARSER_ENGINE&quot;">
  <data key="d5">170.0</data>
