<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;**Special case for P's `chunk_token_size`**: the P `chunk_token_size` slot does NOT walk the full four-tier chain. When ① is not explicitly provided, it resolves directly via `CHUNK_P_SIZE` env &gt; `DEFAULT_CHUNK_P_SIZE` (2000), **skipping** ③ legacy constructor field `LightRAG(chunk_token_size=…)` and ④ legacy env `CHUNK_SIZE`. See the `CHUNK_P_SIZE` row in §3.2 for the rationale.&quot;" target="&quot;CHUNK_SIZE&quot;">
