</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FORMAT&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Proportional constraints: `table_max &lt; target_ideal &lt; target_max`, `table_ideal &lt; table_max`. These ratios come from audit-mode empirical values (`large block 8000, small table 5000, ideal table 3000, table tail block 1600`) and are now scaled proportionally by `chunk_token_size`.">
  <data key="d5">70.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b84c6dc4e56f32ef79bfc21440cf2ef4</data>
</edge>
