<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;On macOS, Gunicorn multi-worker mode also requires the Objective-C fork-safety override to be present before the Python process starts. Do not rely on `.env` for this variable; `.env` is loaded after Python startup and is too late for the Objective-C runtime: export OBJC_DISABLE_INITIALIZE_FORK_SAFETY=YES lightrag-gunicorn --workers 2 &quot;" target="&quot;WORKERS&quot;">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1417f2fecf74afcbf4d69be846fd679a</data>
