<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Example Response (with chunk content):{&quot;response&quot;:&quot;LightRAG is a graph-based RAG system...&quot;,&quot;references&quot;:[{&quot;reference_id&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;file_path&quot;:&quot;/documents/intro.md&quot;,&quot;content&quot;:[&quot;LightRAG is a retrieval-augmented generation system that combines knowledge graphs with vector similarity search...&quot;,&quot;The system uses a dual-indexing approach with both vector embeddings and graph structures for enhanced retrieval...&quot;]},{&quot;reference_id&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;file_path&quot;:&quot;/documents/features.md&quot;,&quot;content&quot;:[&quot;The system provides multiple query modes including local, global, hybrid, and mix modes...&quot;]}]&quot;" target="&quot;RESPONSE&quot;">
