<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;For example, the chat message `/mix What's LightRAG?` will trigger a mix mode query for LightRAG. A chat message without a query prefix will trigger a hybrid mode query by default." target="&quot;MIX MODE QUERY&quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e07113c82d8f800d43e240dceb9a4230</data>
</edge>
