</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;`/bypass` is not a LightRAG query mode; it will tell the API Server to pass the query directly to the underlying LLM, including the chat history. So the user can use the LLM to answer questions based on the chat history." target="&quot;BYPASS MODE&quot;">
