<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The v1.5.0rc2 release adds the new file-processing pipeline, parser routing, multimodal analysis, role-specific LLM/VLM configuration, JSON entity extraction, and several provider/storage changes. Review the [v1.5.0rc2 release notes](https://github.com/HKUDS/LightRAG/releases/tag/v1.5.0rc2) before upgrading a production instance.&quot;" target="&quot;V1.5.0RC2 RELEASE&quot;">
