<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;`ENTITY_TYPES` is no longer supported. Use `ENTITY_TYPE_PROMPT_FILE` instead, with a YAML profile stored under `PROMPT_DIR/entity_type` (`PROMPT_DIR` defaults to `./prompts`). A sample template is available at `prompts/samples/entity_type_prompt.sample.yml`&quot;" target="&quot;ENTITY_TYPES&quot;">
