<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;```bash LIGHTRAG_API_PREFIX=/site01 lightrag-server --port 9621 ``` The backend passes this value to FastAPI as `root_path` and injects the same runtime prefix into the WebUI. The WebUI is always mounted at `/webui` inside the server, so one frontend build can serve any prefix. See [Single-Server Multi-Site Deployment](./MultiSiteDeployment.md) for full Nginx, Docker, and Kubernetes examples." target="&quot;--API-PREFIX&quot;">
  <data key="d5">70.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d7149569405d52b329c2d9c690f051dd</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;```bash LIGHTRAG_API_PREFIX=/site01 lightrag-server --port 9621 ``` The backend passes this value to FastAPI as `root_path` and injects the same runtime prefix into the WebUI. The WebUI is always mounted at `/webui` inside the server, so one frontend build can serve any prefix. See [Single-Server Multi-Site Deployment](./MultiSiteDeployment.md) for full Nginx, Docker, and Kubernetes examples." target="&quot;LIGHTRAG_API_PREFIX&quot;">
  <data key="d5">70.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d7149569405d52b329c2d9c690f051dd</data>
