<edge source="&quot;REDIS_WORKSPACE&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Storage-specific workspace environment variables override the common `WORKSPACE` variable: `REDIS_WORKSPACE`, `MILVUS_WORKSPACE`, `QDRANT_WORKSPACE`, `MONGODB_WORKSPACE`, `POSTGRES_WORKSPACE`, `NEO4J_WORKSPACE`, `OPENSEARCH_WORKSPACE`.&quot;">
