</edge>
<edge source="&quot;POSTGRESQL&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;To maintain compatibility with legacy data, the default workspace for PostgreSQL is 'default' and for Neo4j is 'base' when no workspace is configured.">
