</edge>
<edge source="&quot;POSTGRESQL&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;PostgreSQL is mentioned as an alternative storage solution for LightRAG with additional capabilities such as KV store, VectorDB, and GraphDB (Apache AGE).&quot;">
