</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OPENSEARCH&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;4. Run the OpenSearch storage demo:&lt;br&gt;```bash&lt;br&gt;export OPENSEARCH_HOSTS=localhost:9200\nexport OPENSEARCH_USER=admin\nexport OPENSEARCH_PASSWORD=&lt;custom-admin-password&gt;\nexport OPENSEARCH_USE_SSL=true\nexport OPENSEARCH_VERIFY_CERTS=false\npython examples/opensearch_storage_demo.py&lt;br&gt;```">
