<edge source="&quot;OPENSEARCH&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;5. Run the full OpenAI + OpenSearch demo (requires `OPENAI_API_KEY`):&lt;br&gt;```bash&lt;br&gt;export OPENAI_API_KEY=your-api-key&lt;br&gt;python examples/lightrag_openai_opensearch_graph_demo.py&lt;br&gt;```">
