<edge source="&quot;OPENSEARCH&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;OpenSearch provides a unified storage solution for all four LightRAG storage types (KV, Vector, Graph, DocStatus). It offers native k-NN vector search, full-text search, and horizontal scalability without cloud-only restrictions.&quot;">
