<edge source="&quot;MIX MODE QUERY&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;For example, the chat message `/mix What's LightRAG?` will trigger a mix mode query for LightRAG. A chat message without a query prefix will trigger a hybrid mode query by default.&quot;">
