<edge source="&quot;INCLUDE_CHUNK_CONTENT&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;For evaluation, debugging, or citation purposes, you can request the actual retrieved chunk content to be included in references.&quot;">
  <data key="d5">80.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTENT&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;**Important**: The `content` field is an **array of strings**, where each string represents a chunk from the same file. A single file may correspond to multiple chunks, so the content is returned as a list to preserve chunk boundaries.&quot;">
  <data key="d5">80.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTENT&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;- Prior versions returned `content` as a single concatenated string. Now it returns an array of strings to preserve individual chunk boundaries. If you need a single string, join the array elements with your preferred separator (e.g., `&quot;\n\n&quot;.join(content)`).&quot;">
  <data key="d5">80.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-58732a4b6a97c3eeba3cb6d1206d401e</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTENT&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;blockid computation: `md5(doc_id + &quot;:&quot; + block_index + &quot;:&quot; + heading + &quot;:&quot; + content)` &quot;">
  <data key="d5">120.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a79bee86d871fa85d9e457899f3ff418</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTENT&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;This text provides a table of information about document management metadata for a technical document. It lists various fields such as `id`, `blockid`, `heading`, `parent_headings`, `dimension`, `format`, `content`, `caption`, `footnotes`, `surrounding`, `self_ref`, and `extras`.&quot;">
  <data key="d5">80.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6df28f5232d5c31b9f64164c61a08e65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTENT&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;`format` | &quot;plain_text&quot; &quot;">
  <data key="d5">80.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1394c48f6affe43ef3462e870a7090e</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTENT&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Each content line typically contains: &quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f62767a155c127d2e19bb2a763d570c3</data>
</edge>
