<edge source="&quot;NGINX&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;This document explains how to run multiple isolated LightRAG instances behind one host using a reverse proxy (nginx, Traefik, Kubernetes Ingress, …), with one shared WebUI build reused by every instance.&quot;">
  <data key="d5">80.0</data>
