<edge source="&quot;CONFIGURATIONS&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;LightRAG uses dynamic package installation (`pipmaster`) for optional features based on file types and configurations. In offline environments, these dynamic installations will fail. This guide shows you how to pre-install all necessary dependencies and cache files.&quot;">
