</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHUNKER SETTINGS&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Changing chunker settings (CHUNK_*), affects documents enqueued after the server restarts. Reprocess older documents if you want their stored chunk_options snapshot to match the new settings.">
