<edge source="&quot;BEDROCK&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;| `bedrock` | Supported, using `{ROLE}_LLM_BINDING_HOST` as `endpoint_url`; `DEFAULT_BEDROCK_ENDPOINT` means letting the AWS SDK choose. | Generic API keys are not supported. | Uses global or role-level SigV4. `AWS_BEARER_TOKEN_BEDROCK` is process-level and cannot be overridden per role. &quot;">
