  <data key="d6">chunk-0a5f058377b951c53da07f784f3944ef</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TIMEOUT SETTINGS&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;4. **Timeout Settings**: Large file uploads and LLM generation require longer timeouts; adjust `proxy_read_timeout` and `proxy_send_timeout` accordingly.&quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a514646a651da9026d7f8eb73aa2f08</data>
</edge>
