</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SIZE VALIDATION LAYERS&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;4. **Timeout Settings**: Large file uploads and LLM generation require longer timeouts; adjust `proxy_read_timeout` and `proxy_send_timeout` accordingly.&quot;">
