<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Different instances need to access the same database instance, but data isolation must be achieved using workspaces to prevent data conflict and destruction.&quot;" target="&quot;INSTANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1417f2fecf74afcbf4d69be846fd679a</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The command-line 'workspace' argument and the 'WORKSPACE' environment variable in the '.env' file can be used to specify the workspace name for the current instance, with the command-line argument having higher priority.&quot;" target="&quot;COMMAND-LINE 'WORKSPACE' ARGUMENT&quot;">
