<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;`/bypass` is not a LightRAG query mode; it will tell the API Server to pass the query directly to the underlying LLM, including the chat history. So the user can use the LLM to answer questions based on the chat history. If you are using Open WebUI as a front end, you can just switch the model to a normal LLM instead of using the `/bypass` prefix.&quot;" target="&quot;BYPASS&quot;">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
