<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;`/bypass` is not a LightRAG query mode; it will tell the API Server to pass the query directly to the underlying LLM, including the chat history. &quot;" target="&quot;BYPASS&quot;">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e07113c82d8f800d43e240dceb9a4230</data>
</edge>
