<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;`enrich_sidecars_with_surrounding` is idempotent: each `analyze_multimodal` entry point recomputes and overwrites `surrounding`, so after changing `SURROUNDING_LEADING_MAX_TOKENS` / `SURROUNDING_TRAILING_MAX_TOKENS` there is no need to manually clean the sidecar — just re-run multimodal analysis and `surrounding` will be rewritten under the new budget.&quot;" target="&quot;ENRICH_SIDECARS_WITH_SURROUNDING&quot;">
  <data key="d5">70.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0457e4c69abfc4709a265a8f9f349adb</data>
</edge>
