<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;`table_slice` | Optional reserved field; indicates whether the block contains only a slice of a table. The current analysis engines do not split long tables, so this field is fixed to `&quot;none&quot;` (meaning the table will not be sliced) &quot;" target="&quot;TABLE_SLICE&quot;">
