</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The chunking strategies `F` / `R` / `V` that ignore document section structure operate on the concatenated `content` fields. &quot;" target="&quot;CHUNKING STRATEGIES F/R/V&quot;">
