<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;When LightRAG uses multimodal-capable content parsing engines such as native/mineru/docling to extract file content, it splits &quot;body text + multimodal objects + parsing metadata&quot; into a `*.parsed/` directory.&quot;" target="&quot;MULTIMODAL-CAPABLE CONTENT PARSING ENGINES&quot;">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
