</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;When LightRAG uses multimodal-capable content parsing engines such as native/mineru/docling to extract file content, it splits &quot;body text + multimodal objects + parsing metadata&quot; into a `*.parsed/` directory.&quot;" target="&quot;NATIVE/MINERU/DOCLING&quot;">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-33d111aa7def535c2ef43b93f5b747d7</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The MI012 module is used to support the oxygen-supply and anti-gravity control function of the oxygen-supply and anti-gravity regulator... &quot;" target="&quot;MI012 MODULE&quot;">
  <data key="d5">180.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1394c48f6affe43ef3462e870a7090e</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The MI012 module is used to support the oxygen-supply and anti-gravity control function of the oxygen-supply and anti-gravity regulator... &quot;" target="&quot;OXYGEN-SUPPLY AND ANTI-GRAVITY CONTROL FUNCTION&quot;">
