<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The purpose of publicly documenting the **LightRAG Sidecar** format is to make it convenient for community developers to write their own content parsing engines.&quot;" target="&quot;COMMUNITY DEVELOPERS&quot;">
