<edge source="&quot;HEADING&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;This pre-pass only guarantees the heading is **never detached from its child content**; it does not lock the whole as an independent block — so letting `2.3 + 2.4 + 2.4.1` share one chunk when size allows is exactly the intended anti-fragmentation behaviour.&quot;">
