</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEVEL&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;- **docling**: `label=&quot;title&quot;` → level 1, `label=&quot;section_header&quot;` → `item.level + 1` (default level 2), likewise maintaining the parent chain.&quot;">
  <data key="d5">60.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-631139d87a5854bded80f7eef24fed9c</data>
</edge>
