<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Software packages requiring `transformers`, `torch`, or `cuda` will not be included in the offline dependency group. Consequently, document extraction tools such as Docling, as well as local LLM models like Hugging Face and LMDeploy, are outside the scope of offline installation support. These high-compute-resource-demanding services should not be integrated into LightRAG. Docling will be decoupled and deployed as a standalone service.&quot;" target="&quot;TORCH&quot;">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-282ce1c61fc13efc3e86b9d5f4e51547</data>
</edge>
