<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;**Rule**: **process from deeper levels to shallower levels** — first merge same-level small blocks (Phase A), then batch-absorb the tail, finally allow shallow blocks to absorb deep blocks (Phase B); every merge must simultaneously satisfy four constraints: size, table role, level, and parent-heading path." target="&quot;RULE&quot;">
