<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;**Effect**: many 100–300 token fine-grained clauses are merged toward near `target_ideal` (chunks are no longer too short and semantically thin), while **never lumping together adjacent small blocks that belong to different topics / different parent sections** — curing both &quot;chunks too small&quot; and &quot;cross-topic pollution&quot;.&quot;" target="&quot;TARGET_IDEAL&quot;">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d5becb2ed078b428ad8287c1f5c91acf</data>
</edge>
