<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;When dealing with tables, the P strategy ensures that tables under a certain size (`table_max`) remain whole, and large tables are sliced along row boundaries and re-wrapped as `&lt;table&gt;` elements.&quot;" target="&quot;TABLE_MAX&quot;">
