<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;| TableRowSplit finds a single row that cannot be kept within `target_max` alongside its header (the row content exceeds the cap, or it fits but the header would push it over) | **The whole table (header included) degrades to R-strategy character splitting and a `logger.warning` is logged**; the header content survives as plain text along with the original table text |&quot;" target="&quot;TABLEROWSPLIT FINDS A SINGLE ROW THAT CANNOT BE KEPT WITHIN TARGET_MAX ALONGSIDE ITS HEADER&quot;">
  <data key="d5">80.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a157ba8bb77c0492f14d1d2322564184</data>
</edge>
