<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;- **Cross-level absorption (Phase B, shallow-absorbs-deep)**: the deep block must be a **descendant** of the shallow one — the shallow block's full heading path (`parent_headings` + its own `heading`, with any `[part n]` stripped) must be a prefix of the deep block's `parent_headings`. A shallow block absorbing a deep block from a different branch is forbidden." target="&quot;CROSS-LEVEL ABSORPTION (PHASE B, SHALLOW-ABSORBS-DEEP)&quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d5becb2ed078b428ad8287c1f5c91acf</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;- **Cross-level absorption (Phase B, shallow-absorbs-deep)**: the deep block must be a **descendant** of the shallow one — the shallow block's full heading path (`parent_headings` + its own `heading`, with any `[part n]` stripped) must be a prefix of the deep block's `parent_headings`. A shallow block absorbing a deep block from a different branch is forbidden." target="&quot;DESCENDANT&quot;">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d5becb2ed078b428ad8287c1f5c91acf</data>
</edge>
