<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;1. **Section boundaries never overlap**: text between different `.blocks.jsonl` content lines is never copied into each other's chunks, avoiding mis-attribution." target="&quot;SECTION BOUNDARY&quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
