</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;For adjacent blocks at the current level, when **the current block** is below `target_ideal`, the merged real token count is ≤ `target_max`, and the constraints above are satisfied, merge them into one block (the absorbed(&quot;hyper-relation&quot;" target="&quot;CURRENT BLOCK&quot;">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d5becb2ed078b428ad8287c1f5c91acf</data>
</edge>
