</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;4. Table rows never overlap each other: row-level slicing is itself non-overlapping, distinct from R's overlap concept." target="&quot;TABLE ROW&quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
