  <data key="d6">chunk-b84c6dc4e56f32ef79bfc21440cf2ef4</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;- Because merging inserts a newline joiner, summing per-block token counts may underestimate the merged result. **Before committing every merge, recompute the token count on the joined real text** and confirm it does not exceed `target_max` before committing." target="&quot;TOKEN COUNT&quot;">
