<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The document contains several environment variable configurations for Bedrock LLM and related services. It advises not to set `QUERY_LLM_BINDING_API_KEY` and explains the behavior of other environment variables. It also provides information on caveats for using different providers and configurations in Docker/Compose, as well as instructions for modifying `.env` and restarting LightRAG Server.&quot;" target="&quot;BEDROCK LLM&quot;">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fafd91616983a2b5530ef7502802db23</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The document contains several environment variable configurations for Bedrock LLM and related services. It advises not to set `QUERY_LLM_BINDING_API_KEY` and explains the behavior of other environment variables. It also provides information on caveats for using different providers and configurations in Docker/Compose, as well as instructions for modifying `.env` and restarting LightRAG Server.&quot;" target="&quot;QUERY_BEDROCK_LLM_MAX_TOKENS&quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fafd91616983a2b5530ef7502802db23</data>
</edge>
