</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;For architecture background, see RFC #3197; for the sidecar file format, see `docs/LightRAGSidecarFormat.md`; for CLI usage, see `docs/ParserDebugCLI.md`.&quot;" target="&quot;RFC #3197&quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-befc9ee33b58f79fec1dbee2eaeae5f2</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;For architecture background, see RFC #3197; for the sidecar file format, see `docs/LightRAGSidecarFormat.md`; for CLI usage, see `docs/ParserDebugCLI.md`.&quot;" target="&quot;LIGHTRAGSIDECARFORMAT.MD&quot;">
