<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The `BaseParser` subclass must implement the `parse` method, which is the entry point for the parsing logic. This method takes a `ParseContext` object as an argument, which contains all the necessary information about the document to be parsed, such as the document identifier, file path, and content data. The implementation of the `parse` method should handle the parsing logic and return a `ParseResult` object, which contains the parsing results and any necessary metadata." target="&quot;BASEPARSER SUBCLASS&quot;">
