<edge source="&quot;SUMMARY&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The default pipeline produces a series of output tables that align with the [conceptual knowledge model](../index/default_dataflow.md). This page describes the detailed output table schemas. By default we write these tables out as parquet files on disk.&quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f79b90a7af3598028d581d94c6d76678</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Factories enable the registration of custom implementations." target="&quot;REGISTRATION OF CUSTOM IMPLEMENTATIONS&quot;">
