<edge source="&quot;SETTINGS.YAML&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;- `settings.yaml` contains the settings for the pipeline. You can modify this file to change the settings for the pipeline.&quot;">
  <data key="d5">80.0</data>
