</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SETTINGS.YAML&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Also see the [outputs](outputs.md) documentation for the final documents table schema saved to parquet after pipeline completion.">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
