</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SETTINGS.YAML&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;With the CSV format you can configure the `text_column`, and `title_column` if your data has structured content you would prefer to use. If you do not configure these within the `input` block of your settings.yaml, the title will be the filename as described in the schema above. The `text_column` is assumed to be &quot;text&quot; in your file if not configured specifically.">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-813bfd09c5663aba506972a834914fb8</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SETTINGS.YAML&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;Note that some of the settings recommended below are based on our own experience of what works well. Feel free to change and explore other settings for a better visualization experience!&quot;">
