<edge source="&quot;TEXT_UNIT_IDS&quot;" target="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;The default pipeline produces a series of output tables that align with the [conceptual knowledge model](../index/default_dataflow.md). This page describes the detailed output table schemas. By default we write these tables out as parquet files on disk.&quot;">
