<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;- `TextUnit` - A chunk of text to analyze. The size of these chunks, their overlap, and whether they adhere to any data boundaries may be configured below.&quot;" target="&quot;TEXTUNIT&quot;">
