  <data key="d6">chunk-7e8c003efcd580037bb1cdeb5a33b78f</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;In this step, we generate a summary of each community using the LLM. This will allow us to understand the distinct information contained within each community and provide a scoped understanding of the graph, from either a high-level or a low-level perspective. These reports contain an executive overview and reference the key entities, relationships, and claims within the community sub-structure.&quot;" target="&quot;SCOPED UNDERSTANDING &quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1510fdc0a4611e7ac84d55abc79e6e54</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;In this step, we generate a summary of each community using the LLM. This will allow us to understand the distinct information contained within each community and provide a scoped understanding of the graph, from either a high-level or a low-level perspective. These reports contain an executive overview and reference the key entities, relationships, and claims within the community sub-structure.&quot;" target="&quot;LLM &quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1510fdc0a4611e7ac84d55abc79e6e54</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;In this step, we generate a summary of each community using the LLM. This will allow us to understand the distinct information contained within each community and provide a scoped understanding of the graph, from either a high-level or a low-level perspective. These reports contain an executive overview and reference the key entities, relationships, and claims within the community sub-structure.&quot;" target="&quot;COMMUNITY &quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1510fdc0a4611e7ac84d55abc79e6e54</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;In this step, we generate a summary of each community using the LLM. This will allow us to understand the distinct information contained within each community and provide a scoped understanding of the graph, from either a high-level or a low-level perspective. These reports contain an executive overview and reference the key entities, relationships, and claims within the community sub-structure.&quot;" target="&quot;DISTINCT INFORMATION &quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1510fdc0a4611e7ac84d55abc79e6e54</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;These subgraphs are merged together - any entities with the same _title_ and _type_ are merged by creating an array of their descriptions. Similarly, any relationships with the same _source_ and _target_ are merged by creating an array of their descriptions.&quot;" target="&quot;RELATIONSHIPS &quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1510fdc0a4611e7ac84d55abc79e6e54</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;These subgraphs are merged together - any entities with the same _title_ and _type_ are merged by creating an array of their descriptions. Similarly, any relationships with the same _source_ and _target_ are merged by creating an array of their descriptions.&quot;" target="&quot;SUBGRAPHS &quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1510fdc0a4611e7ac84d55abc79e6e54</data>
</edge>
