</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;- `Community` - Once the graph of entities and relationships is built, we perform hierarchical community detection on them to create a clustering structure.&quot;" target="&quot;COMMUNITY&quot;">
  <data key="d5">170.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7e8c003efcd580037bb1cdeb5a33b78f</data>
</edge>
