<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;To address this, the tech community is working to develop methods that extend and enhance RAG. Microsoft Research’s new approach, GraphRAG, creates a knowledge graph based on an input corpus. This graph, along with community summaries and graph machine learning outputs, are used to augment prompts at query time. GraphRAG shows substantial improvement in answering the two classes of questions described above, demonstrating intelligence or mastery that outperforms other approaches previously applied to private datasets.&quot;" target="&quot;KNOWLEDGE GRAPH&quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71f126a1f713fce89f72bd739d4c81eb</data>
