<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;GraphRAG builds upon our prior [research](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/worklab/patterns-hidden-inside-the-org-chart) and [tooling](https://github.com/graspologic-org/graspologic) using graph machine learning. The basic steps of the GraphRAG process are as follows:&quot;" target="&quot;TOOLING&quot;">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
