</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;👉 [Microsoft Research Blog Post](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/blog/graphrag-unlocking-llm-discovery-on-narrative-private-data/)&quot;" target="&quot;MICROSOFT RESEARCH BLOG POST&quot;">
  <data key="d5">85.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71f126a1f713fce89f72bd739d4c81eb</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;To learn more about GraphRAG and how it can be used to enhance your language model's ability to reason about your private data, please visit the [Microsoft Research Blog Post](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/blog/graphrag-unlocking-llm-discovery-on-narrative-private-data/).&quot;" target="&quot;MICROSOFT RESEARCH BLOG POST&quot;">
  <data key="d5">170.0</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-71f126a1f713fce89f72bd739d4c81eb</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;* Note that this will overwrite your configuration and prompts, so backup if necessary.*&quot;" target="&quot;OVERWRITE&quot;">
