</edge>
<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;- Slice up an input corpus into a series of TextUnits, which act as analyzable units for the rest of the process, and provide fine-grained references in our outputs.&quot;" target="&quot;INPUT CORPUS&quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
