<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;With the CSV format you can configure the `text_column`, and `title_column` if your data has structured content you would prefer to use. If you do not configure these within the `input` block of your settings.yaml, the title will be the filename as described in the schema above. The `text_column` is assumed to be &quot;text&quot; in your file if not configured specifically." target="&quot;CSV FORMAT&quot;">
  <data key="d5">90.0</data>
