<edge source="&lt;hyperedge&gt;&quot;GraphRAG is a platform for our research into RAG indexing methods that produce optimal context window content for language models. We have a standard indexing pipeline that uses a language model to extract the graph that our memory model is based upon. We may introduce additional indexing methods from time to time. This page documents those options.&quot;" target="&quot;CONTEXT WINDOW CONTENT&quot;">
